


translate english day_2_4a64635e:


    "It has come, after all."


translate english day_2_69109f50:


    "The day I feared the most. The first day of a new school term."


translate english day_2_e455a3dd:


    "New school, new teachers, and most importantly, new classmates, who I always have trouble connecting with."


translate english day_2_8b078bd6:


    "Like most other kids with glasses, probably."


translate english day_2_68530f61:


    "I forced myself to get out of my warm bed."


translate english day_2_a1a382ed:


    "Dad would usually drive me to my old school, but this morning the bedroom of my parents was silent."


translate english day_2_ee9d7d60:


    "Did they sleep in?"


translate english day_2_74379b13:


    "Maybe it was a good thing. I didn't want to get the daddy's boy reputation from day one."


translate english day_2_f516153c:


    "My parents were probably still tucked in, dreaming about the good old days, when everything was so simple and easy."


translate english day_2_245c85a2:


    "Sweet dreams, even if far removed from reality."


translate english day_2_4b8569f4:


    "I silently sneaked out to the first floor so I wouldn't wake up anybody, especially the peacefully sleeping Olya."


translate english day_2_0333eb45:


    "I did my best to step on the middle of every floorboard."


translate english day_2_2dfc59fa:


    "I used to play like this even in our old apartment: if my soles touched the space between floorboards, it counted as stepping into lava."


translate english day_2_943aa9b6:


    "The clock was spurring me on with its hands."


translate english day_2_8de4875e:


    "\"{i}I need to hurry. Faster! Faster!{/i}\""


translate english day_2_c786074b:


    "I was too fast, so I needed to circle the hallway once again."


translate english day_2_5ed81b15:


    "Boiling lava was bursting out of the cracks between floorboards."


translate english day_2_ce3dfe22:


    "I needed to watch my step. To survive at any cost."


translate english day_2_2a3421c5:


    "Hippity-hop, like a frog jumping on molehills, like a fearful bunny in a grove full of wolves."


translate english day_2_5789e4c7:


    "I made a sandwich in the kitchen, shoved it down my throat and drank it down with cold tea."


translate english day_2_833afc9f:


    "My appetite was as good as of someone being led up the scaffold, toward a guillotine."


translate english day_2_eaaa15da:


    "I lowered my gaze and saw that one of my feet was standing on two floorboards at the same time."


translate english day_2_f3781d62:


    "Burnt to a crisp, huh?"


translate english day_2_d976edc9:


    "I moved my foot."


translate english day_2_513d8bfb:


    "Disgusting little snakes writhed in my belly – the fear of getting hit and being called nasty names."


translate english day_2_d68b2d95:


    "The clock clicked."


translate english day_2_93b4a5b7:


    "I need to go..."


translate english day_2_fe359838:


    "It was dark outside, fitting for an early winter morning."


translate english day_2_2f0a6aab:


    "This darkness never fully left the houses around here."


translate english day_2_4f13e332:


    "I took my time tying my shoes, buttoning up the puffy down jacket, trying to delay my unpleasant exit into the semi-dark, into the unnerving unknown."


translate english day_2_d6da1875:


    "I rubbed my glasses for good luck, though I couldn't remember a single time these thick pieces of glass brought me any good fortune."


translate english day_2_89cef133:


    "The sky was akin to a giant bruise."


translate english day_2_cabb99c8:


    "On the east side of it, a black cloud was swelling up."


translate english day_2_652ae011:


    "It licked up stars from the sky and extinguished the rising sun."


translate english day_2_5b2f484a:


    "Darkness was plastered all over the treetops."


translate english day_2_fa83fe6a:


    "The cautious cries of birds got tangled up in the thicket."


translate english day_2_4367a956:


    "I locked the front door with a long key that I wore around my neck."


translate english day_2_b69b6d48:


    "My parents made me wear this noose, afraid that I, being a total klutz that I am, could lose the key otherwise."


translate english day_2_e3760854:


    "The wind whizzed on the other side of the gate. It invited me into my new life, toward dubious adventures."


translate english day_2_b5ed99c3:


    "And tagged alone like an old buddy, pushing me in the back."


translate english day_2_47909a50:


    "Wide shadows that pines threw out covered a third of the clearing."


translate english day_2_2e531e60:


    "Upon reaching the edge of the forest, I hid my nose in the coat's collar."


translate english day_2_6048fe40:


    "I was squeezing through the thin firebreak, my hair ruffled up and my back hunched over."


translate english day_2_6759ca3a:


    "Tall trees stood on both sides of the tiny trail."


translate english day_2_cb093434:


    "The snowy blanket rustled under my feet and the canopy of intertwined branches above my head cut me off from the already sparse starlight."


translate english day_2_2447d0a5:


    "The night had no plans of moving away from the forest."


translate english day_2_e20515b2:


    "In this darkness, trees reminded me of shaggy old women that smelled of burial earth."


translate english day_2_3b7c736d:


    "Their trunks turned into cracked, wrinkled faces with holes in the middle as their mouths."


translate english day_2_895d36f7:


    "If I lost focus even for a moment, mold-covered witches would drag me into the forest's depths."


translate english day_2_a89d0594:


    "Then my parents would be walking around these parts, screaming my name."


translate english day_2_34f65a16:


    "But the dead can't answer the living."


translate english day_2_278405ab:


    "Or can they?"


translate english day_2_637ea244:


    "A sense of panic was growing in my chest."


translate english day_2_021cb2a1:


    "I was fine with dad carrying me into the school in his hands by now if it saved me from watching the darkness rise up in the ravines like black dough."


translate english day_2_76df1dfc:


    "It felt like someone jumped into the bushes behind me so I turned around."


translate english day_2_9d084f36:


    "As soon as I started walking faster, I heard the snow squeak behind me."


translate english day_2_deccaee2:


    "The forest took a deep breath with its giant lungs. The windfall cracked."


translate english day_2_c6dbec35:


    "The wind and the birds were left behind in the field. Now I could only hear the forest creak."


translate english day_2_c52bd074:


    "I walked, listening closely, and the unseen presence grew stronger."


translate english day_2_ef99108f:


    "As if someone was following me, trying to match the pace of my footsteps."


translate english day_2_7064dff6:


    "I turned my head so fast it made my neck crunch." with hpunch


translate english day_2_b142b6f1:


    "A tiny trail behind me disappeared into the darkness."


translate english day_2_15d22a72:


    "Tree branches overlapped, forming a natural tunnel."


translate english day_2_414518c3:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Esttzdes.ogg"
    Ant "Who's there?"


translate english day_2_83f676f2:


    "The question escaped my lips and dissolved into the unending creaking sound of the wooden idols, the pines around me."


translate english day_2_8d41dc73:


    "Why did I think going through the forest alone was a good idea?"


translate english day_2_8ceebdf2:


    "I'm either going mad..."


translate english day_2_ab48e614:


    "Or someone had intentionally lured me away from home."


translate english day_2_02fc9cf0:


    "Distant lights granted me a smidgen of hope."


translate english day_2_da33aebd:


    "A country road!"


translate english day_2_462b9ddb:


    "I ran there as fast as I could, as if afraid that the trail will shrink, clawed hands will grip me by the shoulders, turn me around and make me look at the faces of hungry forest denizens."


translate english day_2_7b40a761:


    "In the end, nobody stopped me."


translate english day_2_744d6a54:


    "I almost flew to the decrepit wooden bridge, disbelieving my luck."


translate english day_2_f9f045c6:


    "The bridge's supports bathed in a spring, tarry and ice cold."


translate english day_2_a94b76ba:


    "I put my hands on my knees and looked up at the forest."


translate english day_2_c7e68fd9:


    "Then snorted, trying to calm my breathing."


translate english day_2_e0a1fe4a:


    "The thicket was pretending to be asleep. It looked peaceful, lifeless."


translate english day_2_a4a7877b:


    "The remaining part of my commute lied through a snow-laden road, illuminated by sparse lamplights."


translate english day_2_a1575e0e:


    "I chased away bad thoughts and ran as fast as I could, from one circle of light to another, seeking protection from electric lamps."


translate english day_2_27e47e55:


    "Just like in that {u}game{/u}, where you need to be the first to proclaim: \"I'm protected!\""


translate english day_2_e7d4f413:


    "It's just in this case that protection was flimsy at best, with darkness writhing outside its bounds."


translate english day_2_62ecf647:


    "Then I noticed something remarkably eerie."


translate english day_2_19c9d821:


    "In a place where the light from an inclined lamp couldn't reach, a hairy, crooked shadow came alive with a guttural roar."


translate english day_2_aae0cfae:


    "It almost felt like its features deterred light. Its unnatural pose instilled fear."


translate english day_2_27f79253:


    "My eyes almost popped out of their sockets, as I just stood there, blinking, trying to chase away that illusion."


translate english day_2_88fa731e:


    "But the shadow didn't disappear and even got closer."


translate english day_2_04d424cb:


    "My insides were gripped by horror. I stepped back and almost fell into a snow pile."


translate english day_2_70f84ab6:


    "The black silhouette, on the other hand, straightened up and addressed me in a sweet voice:"


translate english day_2_ef7a8781:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/01 Chego krad.ogg"
    Noname "Sneaking around, huh? Trying to steal my soul?"


translate english day_2_ac1f1abe:


    "Words got stuck in my throat."


translate english day_2_2ec69fac:


    "Who could be talking in such a silky voice here, between the forest and the dormant village?"


translate english day_2_42a13568:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/02 Chego molch.ogg"
    Noname "Will you say something, dummy?"


translate english day_2_d81fb3bf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/03 Yazik.ogg"
    Noname "A cat got your tongue?"


translate english day_2_13dc5602:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/04 Slushai.ogg"
    Noname "Alright, I'll bite off your nose, then!"


translate english day_2_aed2a0e3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/05 Budesh.ogg"
    Noname "That'll teach you not to poke it in places it doesn't belong!"


translate english day_2_f245ab3c:


    "A girl stood before me, judging from the voice and the silhouette."


translate english day_2_93c7905f:


    "But I couldn't even reprimand myself for getting scared by a girl, before noticing a gaping mouth under her hood with something dangerously shiny inside."


translate english day_2_7012ee07:


    "I was stunned."


translate english day_2_1bef4fc8:


    "From the cavity of her hood, a frighteningly real fox face was staring straight at me."


translate english day_2_bdb15fe0:


    "It's just her jaws weren't moving and her eyes weren't blinking."


translate english day_2_6c555dc0:


    "A mask!"


translate english day_2_418d00da:


    "It's just a girl! With a fox mask on!"


translate english day_2_50fff986:


    "At least I wanted to think that."


translate english day_2_b6d8144f:


    "After a surprise like that, a nervous smile involuntary crept onto my face."


translate english day_2_fd776f95:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/01 A ya.ogg"
    Ant "I was just..."


translate english day_2_463e191f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/01.2 Prosto v shkolu.ogg"
    Ant "Going to school and then... you."


translate english day_2_e838113a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/06 Chto ya.ogg"
    Fox "What about me?"


translate english day_2_7705fd7c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/07 Nikogda ne videl.ogg"
    Fox "Never seen a fox feed a dog?"


translate english day_2_03a594fb:


    "And indeed, there was a small dog circling the girl's legs. One of the strays that were chasing me yesterday, probably."


translate english day_2_ebbe58f7:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/002. Izvinite.ogg"
    Ant "Sorry, I didn't mean to..."


translate english day_2_a29f0b35:


    "After hearing my voice, the dog whimpered, lowered its ears, sniffed me out and then started wagging its tail."


translate english day_2_ccd112dd:


    "I guess I still smelled of bologna that I ate for breakfast."


translate english day_2_9c3e25e8:


    "I was shifting my gaze back and forth from the dog to the girl. She didn't seem scary anymore—just weird."


translate english day_2_4846dd9d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/08 Znachit.ogg"
    Fox "So you didn't mean to, huh...?"


translate english day_2_f0fd4629:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/09 Kak tebya zovut.ogg"
    Fox "What's your name?"


translate english day_2_1ed3beb0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/03 Menya Anton.ogg"
    Ant "I'm Anton..."


translate english day_2_92af4567:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/03.2 A tebya.ogg"
    Ant "And you?"


translate english day_2_db917fdb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/10 A menya net.ogg"
    Fox "And I'm not!"


translate english day_2_771fae6b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/11 A menya net.ogg"
    Fox "Hehehe!"


translate english day_2_d59fc924:


    "She's weird. Definitely has a couple loose screws."


translate english day_2_0adbab9b:


    "But she has a nice voice."


translate english day_2_b3ccfe7f:


    "My astonishment has turned into a mix of happiness and relief. This girl I didn't know was definitely human, if a bit eccentric."


translate english day_2_a6e32563:


    "I was also a bit angry at myself."


translate english day_2_a98754a5:


    "This foxy girl was walking through the darkness without problem, and I shuddered from every little sound."


translate english day_2_9be9a247:


    "I could just walk away, but this girl had piqued my interest."


translate english day_2_a10de9a6:


    "The next time a police officer asks me about my friends at the new place, I'll tell him that I befriended a talking fox!"


translate english day_2_5e3c78a4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/04 Ti zdes.ogg"
    Ant "Do you live around here?"


translate english day_2_2bb56445:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/04.2 V poselke.ogg"
    Ant "In the village?"


translate english day_2_21739059:


    "The fox giggled and purred."


translate english day_2_5b845613:


    "She spun around so hard the hem of her coat lifted up."


translate english day_2_d6303652:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/12 Net glupiy.ogg"
    Fox "No, dummy."


translate english day_2_b9334905:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/13 Foxes ne.ogg"
    Fox "Foxes don't live in villages."


translate english day_2_0249eda9:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/005. Hochesh.ogg"
    Ant "So you live in the forest, then?"


translate english day_2_4b4dd17a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/14 Iz kakoy.ogg"
    Fox "Have you been living under a rock?"


translate english day_2_4aa617ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/15 Konechno lisam.ogg"
    Fox "It's obvious that foxes can't survive anywhere near humans..."


translate english day_2_2ce37276:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/16 Poka oni.ogg"
    Fox "As long as they're foxes."


translate english day_2_3de4d675:


    "Her jokes were also weird."


translate english day_2_aaeb6e63:


    "Just like her carnival mask... Papier-mâché with fur glued onto it."


translate english day_2_1ea41c14:


    "A dog reminded us of its existence with a loud bark."


translate english day_2_23e73012:


    "I unfastened my backpack."


translate english day_2_fadf3a54:


    "Dad would sometimes throw food in there without my knowledge: cookies, apples or even my favorite crab sticks."


translate english day_2_ea2ed902:


    "He called it \"A gift from the {u}bunny{/u}\"."


translate english day_2_c3248724:


    "The stray strolled toward me with mincing footsteps, with a pleading look in its eyes."


translate english day_2_a1a90eca:


    "The fox did definitely treat it to something, but it was probably still hungry."


translate english day_2_5a0fd2b2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/06 Zachem ti tak.ogg"
    Ant "Why are you dressed like this so early in the morning?"


translate english day_2_18e07141:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/06.2 Na utrennik.ogg"
    Ant "Going to a costume party?"


translate english day_2_ab9f552a:


    "The girl shrugged, throwing silvery snowflakes off her nose."


translate english day_2_fed51f3e:


    "And her human form along with them..."


translate english day_2_d70b00c9:


    "...turning into a genuine beast."


translate english day_2_ffae7724:


    "A real fox — agile, cunning, dangerous."


translate english day_2_bd3a17f2:


    "A moment of hesitation and you'll be ripped to shreds. She'll tear you up and gulp you down without breaking a sweat."


translate english day_2_05141ac1:


    "I couldn't help but just stand there as a stump."


translate english day_2_de3ddf3e:


    "Until I heard her calm, melodic laughter, hidden underneath the beastly mask."


translate english day_2_375527fb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/17 Videl bi ti.ogg"
    Fox "I wish you could've seen your own mask, sweetie."


translate english day_2_26ded833:


    "Swee- did she say sweetie?"


translate english day_2_72004069:


    "I got embarrassed. Went red up to my hair roots."


translate english day_2_ff1c0352:


    "We'd seen a fox in a zoo once, when we went there with dad, but it had patchy fur, was gray and skinny."


translate english day_2_8c15024d:


    "But this girl was of fiery color and furry, just like in fairy tales."


translate english day_2_ceec5ed4:


    "I was still rummaging through my backpack."


translate english day_2_017dbe0c:


    "My fingers, that were searching for the dog's treat, stumbled upon some soft crumpled object..."


translate english day_2_163850a4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/18 Nichego.ogg"
    Fox "You'll see."


translate english day_2_b7824629:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/18 Skoro.ogg"
    Fox "The real beasts will wake up soon."


translate english day_2_459e4854:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/19 Sprosi-ka.ogg"
    Fox "You should ask them where they got their human faces."


translate english day_2_0fd9ac5a:


    "The girl's shadow was dancing in the lamp's light."


translate english day_2_a01ed281:


    "The dog yapped in agreement."


translate english day_2_90020e5c:


    "I freaked out and dropped my finding in the snow without getting a proper chance to examine it."


translate english day_2_7e56891e:


    "Cold wind instantly covered the hole it created with snow."


translate english day_2_5dd21eea:


    "The dog rushed to dig it out, wanting to get its treat."


translate english day_2_e3805f0c:


    "And the fox just snorted."


translate english day_2_2d67a11b:


    "Now I was so embarrassed I wanted to sink through the snow."


translate english day_2_8be6448b:


    "It was still dark outside of the electric circle. On the contrary, the darkness seemed even more thick."


translate english day_2_d9ff757e:


    "All neighboring houses were sleeping deeply in its inkiness."


translate english day_2_f7cef71c:


    "I did my best to continue the conversation with the weird girl I didn't know:"


translate english day_2_67611dd3:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/008. Tak ti v shkolu.ogg"
    Ant "So, are you going to school?"


translate english day_2_ef92ec33:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/20 Oh nu kakoi.ogg"
    Fox "Oh my, you are a real dummy!"


translate english day_2_b8ecc3f1:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/21 Tak nichego.ogg"
    Fox "Don't you get it?"


translate english day_2_ddc879a3:


    "Welp. I was trying to be friendly, but she can't stop mocking me."


translate english day_2_b95eda34:


    "Calling me a dummy and all."


translate english day_2_07a36595:


    "I should've just move along without paying any attention to this weirdo and her stupid dog."


translate english day_2_03347eae:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/09 A chego ti.ogg"
    Ant "Why are you so mean?"


translate english day_2_8344554c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/09.2 Ne hocshesh.ogg"
    Ant "Don't asnwer if you don't want to."


translate english day_2_f2badea1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/09.3 Nikto ne.ogg"
    Ant "It's not like I care."


translate english day_2_0ba01b1a:


    "Still, something froze me in place, tugged me toward the dark figure."


translate english day_2_f9bca01f:


    "A mysterious appearance, her voice that was velvety and just languid enough."


translate english day_2_8fdb25e6:


    "I was intrigued and excited. I watched her as people watch fires burn."


translate english day_2_a62daf8e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/22 Da ne duysa.ogg"
    Fox "Oh, stop pouting."


translate english day_2_02bafc71:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/23 Glyadika.ogg"
    Fox "Look here."


translate english day_2_40dbec55:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/24 Ti nrav.ogg"
    Fox "Zhulka took a liking to you."


translate english day_2_44dcee7e:


    "The dog was digging through snow with sharp movements, snoring loudly."


translate english day_2_49ecdaaa:


    "The fox turned around and looked at the windows of a nearby house, at its timbered front through the white mist."


translate english day_2_68cc0fc9:


    "The tip of her fake nose was shining under the lamp's light."


translate english day_2_cc504fce:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/25 I ne tolko.ogg"
    Fox "And maybe someone else too."


translate english day_2_2f06626e:


    "I went red again, like a boiled crayfish this time."


translate english day_2_48585a89:


    "Is she talking about herself or someone else?"


translate english day_2_41edbcde:


    "I hoped that the semi-dark would be able to hide my embarrassment from the girl."


translate english day_2_2a641530:


    "I cleared my throat before asking."


translate english day_2_7b35a09d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/11.2 A komu eshe ya.ogg"
    Ant "And who's that person?"


translate english day_2_02f07287:


    "I waited, counting my heartbeat."


translate english day_2_9406eb7f:


    "The fox didn't reply."


translate english day_2_f18b593d:


    "Her sly stare was scanning the frosty patterns of someone's windows."


translate english day_2_82b1da84:


    "She was reading them like a glass book."


translate english day_2_7f6d8276:


    "I wonder what she can see in those winter paintings?"


translate english day_2_d3a2a92c:


    "The stray stopped rummaging through the snow."


translate english day_2_4c9d50d5:


    "It ran to me, holding my object in her jaws."


translate english day_2_2a3838ef:


    "A mitten."


translate english day_2_42e1d068:


    "Could it be the one I found in the forest?"


translate english day_2_848adfc4:


    "What is it doing here?"


translate english day_2_e35e209d:


    "When I looked closer, I realized that it was just my mitten."


translate english day_2_04d9bc99:


    "Maybe mom stuffed it in there when I was asleep?"


translate english day_2_a69df6f9:


    "A certain missing boy immediately came to mind."


translate english day_2_3f91f6cb:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/012. Hey ti zhaesh.ogg"
    Ant "Hey, do you know anything about Vova?"


translate english day_2_27af52bc:


    "I imagined the scene: silhouettes, dancing in the clearing."


translate english day_2_5715f2c5:


    "The dance on the night when Vova had disappeared."


translate english day_2_b28a00e8:


    "A boy, who when found, can provide a big reward and maybe save my family."


translate english day_2_a3f70217:


    "I remembered my birthday, when our parents promised to take me and Olya to Disneyland in Paris..."


translate english day_2_91a4305b:


    "...but instead of a long anticipated gift, they gave me a simple Brick Game console, visibly embarrassed."


translate english day_2_0cedd855:


    "I was crying my eyes out back then, demanding to take me to the promised amusement park!"


translate english day_2_48df92dc:


    "That was the first time when mom and dad had a big fight. My greediness shattered their relationship."


translate english day_2_adf44524:


    "If only I could fix everything... Gather everybody I love and take them to Disneyland."


translate english day_2_3996f34c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/013. V noch kogda propal vova.ogg"
    Ant "On the night Vova had disappeared, I think I saw someone looking like you dancing under my window..."


translate english day_2_78bac12b:


    "It couldn't be true, but I felt like her mask became even more sly."


translate english day_2_88bec69a:


    "The fox was sniffing me out."


translate english day_2_eea3bb6c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/26 A chto.ogg"
    Fox "Oh, that got you worried?"


translate english day_2_8a7fc286:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/27 Za sebya.ogg"
    Fox "For yourself, or for someone else?"


translate english day_2_0b22484c:


    "\"Olya!\", as soon as I thought about my sister, my chest tightened, and cold sweat streamed down my spine."


translate english day_2_5a0f6dae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/28 Nu tak.ogg"
    Fox "Well then, listen closely, a boy named Anton."


translate english day_2_eb50549e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/29 Eto.ogg"
    Fox "This is a big and scary forest."


translate english day_2_91feb1e0:


    "The fox girl stepped forward menacingly."


translate english day_2_74bf2953:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/30 I ya.ogg"
    Fox "And I'm not its only tenant."


translate english day_2_77dd6e5c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/31 Drugie zveri.ogg"
    Fox "The other beasts already know about you."


translate english day_2_f6c39562:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/32 Beregis nas.ogg"
    Fox "Beware! We'll come again tonight..."


translate english day_2_02a7e87f:


    "\"I shouldn't have talked to this evil in child form\", I thought, panicking."


translate english day_2_66038c2f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/33 Poka ti.ogg"
    Fox "When you and your parents will be fast asleep, we'll sneak really close and dance..."


translate english day_2_edd6bc83:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/34 Makarenu.ogg"
    Fox "Macarena!"


translate english day_2_808d03fc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/013. Che.ogg"
    Ant "H-huh?"


translate english day_2_c4243d59:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/35 Ei.ogg"
    Fox "Ayy! Macarena!"


translate english day_2_694151b0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/36 U tebya pryamo.ogg"
    Fox "Ahahaha! Look at you, your mouth is agape, Antosha!"


translate english day_2_0daaba3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/37 Videl on menya.ogg"
    Fox "He saw me near his window at night... Yeah, right!"


translate english day_2_89480e74:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/38 A ti sluachaem.ogg"
    Fox "Are you, by any chance, a dimwit?"


translate english day_2_27accf0d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/39 Menya.ogg"
    Fox "Nobody would let me go outside that late."


translate english day_2_f757799e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/40 Zdes.ogg"
    Fox "Children go missing here, you know."


translate english day_2_a5741d36:


    "I touched the plastic frame of my glasses, puzzled by her silly joke."


translate english day_2_52ae95fd:


    "She got me scared to death."


translate english day_2_7550cb8e:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/41 Oi da ne.ogg"
    Fox "Hey, why don't you stop fondling your glasses?"


translate english day_2_1ed188ae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/42 Ya ranshe.ogg"
    Fox "I was also nearsighted once."


translate english day_2_dc9e5aad:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/43 Poslush.ogg"
    Fox "Listen to me and maybe you'll become smarter."


translate english day_2_f47facae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/44 Lisichku.ogg"
    Fox "Remember what do they call foxes?"


translate english day_2_fca7587f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/014. Plutovka.ogg"
    Ant "C-cunning?"


translate english day_2_5f0e4894:


    "My words seemed to hurt her."


translate english day_2_f74b00c4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/45 Ah ti.ogg"
    Fox "Hey! What did you..."


translate english day_2_5d34cc3c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/017. Oi prosti.ogg"
    Ant "Um, sorry."


translate english day_2_d1c9ccfb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/46 Devochka.ogg"
    "Her laughter was akin to the jingle of a pair of silver bells."


translate english day_2_7b3f6a56:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/47 Da shuchu.ogg"
    Fox "Just pulling your leg!"


translate english day_2_4abe5cae:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/48 Konecnho.ogg"
    Fox "Of course we're cunning."


translate english day_2_5aed8c82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/49 Esli ti.ogg"
    Fox "If you're agile and brave enough to befriend a cunning fox, I'll help look for your Vova."


translate english day_2_46859107:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/50 Ti ze.ogg"
    Fox "There's a reason why you're doing it, right?"


translate english day_2_f451757e:


    "I shrugged in reply. Her insight was alarming. "


translate english day_2_67a9e7ee:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/51 I know.ogg"
    Fox "I know why children have been swarming our forest recently."


translate english day_2_ce9c4edf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/52 Poroi tam.ogg"
    Fox "Sometimes, you can find a lot of interesting stuff there."


translate english day_2_9005d1ed:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/53  Ya vot.ogg"
    Fox "One day, I saw a huge pile of candy once and I swam in it until my jaws cramped."


translate english day_2_dd082064:


    "A pile of candy?"


translate english day_2_09651b1c:


    "I couldn't deduce whether she believed in what she was saying from the tone of her voice."


translate english day_2_54292519:


    "I showed her another smile, a fake one this time."


translate english day_2_fc9e0d01:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/54 Posmotrite ka.ogg"
    Fox "Boo, so wary!"


translate english day_2_f51c9b72:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/55 Nu nu.ogg"
    Fox "Well, what will you say to this, then?"


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_429b3c59:


    "She held out her hand in a furry mitten."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_c5f79f26:


    "There was an assortment of sweets in her palm."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_2ab95a6f:


    "In the city where I used to live sweets like these were sold at markets or in {u}kiosks{/u}."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_94e9c3b9:


    "I saw my favorite bubblegum in a vivid wrapper among the tasty treasure."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_8d7fdfd7:


    "A familiar name was on it: \"Turbo\"."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_67f21393:


    "A triangular fox face poked her nose toward me."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_3fb80b79:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/56 Ugosh.ogg"
    Fox "Take some."


translate english dev_night_meet_fox_80269fcf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/56 Y menya ih.ogg"
    Fox "My pockets are full of these."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_3b2e79a0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/018. Net spasibo.ogg"
    Ant "N-no, thanks. I..."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_97c28925:


    "I didn't want to offend the first person I've made contact with in this new place, but I also didn't want to take gum off the hands of some weird girl."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_89aa6e80:


    "What if she found it in a snow pile?"


translate english bunny2_cancel1_c3a69e7e:


    "Or what if it's a prank candy? The kind that blows up in your face when you unwrap it?"


translate english bunny2_cancel1_8b2a295c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/019. U menya na sladkoe.ogg"
    Ant "I'm allergic to sweets."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_e3f94d82:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/57 Aller.ogg"
    Fox "Aller... what?"


translate english bunny2_cancel1_d5028089:


    "She sounded puzzled."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_9652b2f8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/57 Ti chego.ogg"
    Fox "Are you living in the world of pills and mixtures?"


translate english bunny2_cancel1_494f723b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/020.NuvcelomDa.ogg"
    Ant "Well... more or less."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_ed1add6c:


    "The fox whistled."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_ade76418:


    "Her palm was empty now. It floated in the air, catching snowflakes now that all the candy had suddenly disappeared."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_76da18ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/59 I noviy god.ogg"
    Fox "And you only celebrate New Year's once in twelve months, right?"


translate english bunny2_cancel1_252610cc:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/60 I est eti.ogg"
    Fox "And you have those..."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_e1812883:


    "She clicked her fingers, trying to remember something."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_ff16d7ca:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/61 Mondays.ogg"
    Fox "Mondays?"


translate english bunny2_cancel1_b2c74ac4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/21.1Aga.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_2f93a5a8:


    "I smiled."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_17b98afa:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/62 Uu kak.ogg"
    Fox "Maaan, you're a difficult case."


translate english bunny2_cancel1_37d4627c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/63 Vam bi.ogg"
    Fox "I prescribe you a kilo of chocolate to battle your boredom, young man."


translate english bunny2_take1_34a66b32:


    "I accepted the treat and catching a whiff of the girl's smell. Fur, fireworks and citrus... The smell of holidays."


translate english bunny2_take1_5492ee48:


    "My fingers tingled while I was carefully unwrapping the gum."


translate english bunny2_take1_2430d9b4:


    "Peachy aroma entered my nostrils. And something else, something unfamiliar, but pleasant."


translate english bunny2_take1_d2c75814:


    "The fruity cube ended up in my mouth."


translate english bunny2_take1_565cec3b:


    "I started moving my molars, chewing the gum."


translate english bunny2_take1_447258a4:


    "It tasted like your usual Turkish gum, only my tongue went a bit numb."


translate english bunny2_take1_830bcc3c:


    "I couldn't believe my luck after opening the {u}insert{/u}."


translate english bunny2_take1_4485be27:


    "I looked at a Mercedes Benz—an extremely rare and hence desirable collector's item for any boy from my previous neighborhood."


translate english bunny2_take1_3cdb0c74:


    "My heart skipped a beat. I was barely able to tear my eyes off the insert, still stunned."


translate english bunny2_take1_4cf01458:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/022. Eto ze.ogg"
    Ant "This... this is..."


translate english bunny2_take1_a191b1e3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/64 Teper ponyal.ogg"
    Fox "Now do you see what can be found in the forest?"


translate english bunny2_take1_b4875e9a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/65 Tolko na tvoem.ogg"
    Fox "Still, I wouldn't go there alone if I were you."


translate english bunny2_take1_04be4e51:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/66 Tebe von ot.ogg"
    Fox "You get so flustered over simple bubblegum, after all."


translate english bunny2_take1_5273cb27:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/67 A predst.ogg"
    Fox "Imagine what would happen if you find a travel case worth of these?"


translate english bunny2_take1_cba80086:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/68 Golovu.ogg"
    Fox "It'll surely blow your mind."


translate english bunny2_take1_c7b933ef:


    "Unusual treats."


translate english bunny2_take1_0f8da800:


    "Just like everything else about her."


translate english bunny2_take1_65a7c4bf:


    "I carefully hid the insert in my bag, as if I was putting a rare butterfly in a can. The fox giggled."


translate english bunny2_take1_944a71a2:


    "This is not how things are supposed to go on a Monday morning!"


translate english bunny2_cont1_60165612:


    "Who are you?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_3a3fce99:


    "I refrained from asking that question. She wouldn't answer anyway. Or she'll just lie."


translate english bunny2_cont1_8362ccae:


    "I really wanted to see what's behind her mask."


translate english bunny2_cont1_f434882e:


    "I was becoming more and more sure that underneath it wasn't just a simple young girl."


translate english bunny2_cont1_9e04e60a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/70 Mozet Vova.ogg"
    Fox "What if Vova also found a snow pile with sweets and is now rolling in it?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_2093f378:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/71 Slushai.ogg"
    Fox "Actually, what if he decided to stay in the forest...?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_c4af9d85:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/72 Togda navernoe.ogg"
    Fox "He must be so cold without his second mitten, then..."


translate english bunny2_cont1_4ba0c838:


    "The wind caught her words like smoke from a fire and carried them deep into the darkness, into the creepy thicket."


translate english bunny2_cont1_dde789ff:


    "The trees behind me creaked with their bony branches."


translate english bunny2_cont1_1d92fe5b:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/73 Ili s nim.ogg"
    Fox "Or what if... something happened to him along the way?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_accdaae3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/74 Chto-to scary.ogg"
    Fox "Something terrible."


translate english bunny2_cont1_8022bc34:


    "The forest reacted to her words, became alive; it sniffed me out, perking up its ears, just like a curious beast."


translate english bunny2_cont1_77229bac:


    "The fox girl pierced me with her eyes again."


translate english bunny2_cont1_b7a01965:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/024. Dikie zveri.ogg"
    Ant "Wild beasts?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_e9a64b80:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/75 Eto po tvoemu.ogg"
    Fox "You find {i}that{/i} scary?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_7897c010:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/025. Nu ne znay.ogg"
    Ant "Well... I don't know."


translate english bunny2_cont1_cdc8032c:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/76 Ne znaet.ogg"
    Fox "He doesn't know!"


translate english bunny2_cont1_8efd2f80:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/77 Uz ne s.ogg"
    Fox "Oh my, have I befriended a dunce?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_6a5a76a4:


    "I didn't like being called a dunce, yet being friends with her sounded nice."


translate english bunny2_cont1_126a9829:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/026. Ya horoshist.ogg"
    Ant "My grades are good!"


translate english bunny2_cont1_97eaae3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/78 Bel da pus.ogg"
    Fox "Really now?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_d9ca8a00:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/79 Poidesh so mnoi.ogg"
    Fox "Will you come with me, good grades Anton?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_edd08b87:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/80 Naidesh svoego.ogg"
    Fox "We'll find your Vova and you'll be able to ask him what he found deep in the forest."


translate english bunny2_cont1_27c6ded4:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/81 Ved poka mi vmeste.ogg"
    Fox "As long as you're with me, nothing can hurt you in the forest."


translate english bunny2_cont1_52e73d60:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/82 Vot uvidish.ogg"
    Fox "You'll see."


translate english bunny2_cont1_93cfe323:


    "Worms of worry writhed in my belly."


translate english bunny2_cont1_056a93c5:


    "\"Better run\", whispered my mind."


translate english bunny2_cont1_ab629183:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/027. Ya tebe ne veryu.ogg"
    Ant "I don't believe you."


translate english bunny2_cont1_d38dea26:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/83 Ti dumaesh.ogg"
    Fox "Do you take me for a liar?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_f868cbf8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/84 Da i poz.ogg"
    Fox "Whatever, you're just like everybody esle!"


translate english bunny2_cont1_22ad9e93:


    "The girl sounded hurt. Although, I didn't know if she was genuine about it."


translate english bunny2_cont1_e2dafc70:


    "She turned around, as if she had immediately lost all interest in me."


translate english bunny2_cont1_03df2dbb:


    "The gum felt bitter now."


translate english bunny2_cont1_bf099adb:


    "I remembered my dad's favorite saying: \"Where are your manners, son?\""


translate english bunny2_cont1_6ca3efd7:


    "Indeed, this fox was kind to me."


translate english bunny2_cont1_b148834c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/28 Ne obiz.ogg"
    Ant "Please, don't get mad."


translate english bunny2_cont1_d28911a6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/28.2 Lisi bivaut.ogg"
    Ant "Foxes can also be nice..."


translate english bunny2_cont1_d7d086da:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/29 Nu kak v skazkah.ogg"
    Ant "Like in fairy tales."


translate english bunny2_cont1_da812178:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/29.2 Mne bi tolko.ogg"
    Ant "I just need to know what kind of fox you are."


translate english bunny2_cont1_f4ca043d:


    "The girl giggled, hiding the nose of her mask in her hands."


translate english bunny2_cont1_7441e1a8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/95 Togda.ogg"
    Fox "Then follow me into the forest and you'll get to know me."


translate english bunny2_cont1_6ab1d9bb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/96 No ne.ogg"
    Fox "But not right now, when it gets bright. I mean, your whole body is shaking, you poor thing."


translate english bunny2_cont1_7e6db105:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/97 Togo i glyadi.ogg"
    Fox "I don't want you to get a stroke."


translate english bunny2_cont1_aaa84190:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/98 Aida.ogg"
    Fox "Hey, let me accompany you to school."


translate english bunny2_cont1_c585db5b:


    "After hearing this, the dog barked in agreement and stopped messing with the mitten."


translate english bunny2_cont1_2eb44ccb:


    "I leaned in, trying to grab the piece of handwear that almost ran away from me."


translate english bunny2_cont1_587ccbe2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/030. Nu esli tebe po puti.ogg"
    Ant "Well, if we're going in the same direction..."


translate english bunny2_cont1_224c192e:


    "We went toward the school and the lost dawn."


translate english bunny2_cont1_885a5fee:


    "Here and there, the lights came on in the windows of houses we passed, as if their inhabitants were sending us warning signs."


translate english bunny2_cont1_81166c76:


    "Silhouettes lurked behind curtains, dogs let out occasional barks."


translate english bunny2_cont1_463e6304:


    "Spirals of gray smoke rose from chimneys, TVs bustled and dishes clanged in kitchens."


translate english bunny2_cont1_99f44390:


    "We watched the village slowly rise from its slumber, while carefully treading the snowy wheel trails."


translate english bunny2_cont1_d66efb50:


    "I walked in the left one and she took the right one. The dog was following right behind us."


translate english bunny2_cont1_e8d220a1:


    "I expected the fox to bring up something weird again, but she stayed silent all the way to the school, as if playing with me some game only she was privy to."


translate english bunny2_cont1_a0132a05:


    "She would only giggle from time to time, when the dog sneezed from the snowflakes that fell on its nose."


translate english bunny2_cont1_b39fd445:


    "I was the first to break the silence."


translate english bunny2_cont1_d6914285:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/031. Tak kak tebya.ogg"
    Ant "So what's your name?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_002a4078:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/100 Nu konechno.ogg"
    Fox "Here it comes..."


translate english bunny2_cont1_558f1adf:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/101 Imena.ogg"
    Fox "Names, names, names!"


translate english bunny2_cont1_76672992:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/102 Ludyam.ogg"
    Fox "You people always need to put labels on everything."


translate english bunny2_cont1_0edf40a5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/103 Nu i kak bi.ogg"
    Fox "What name would you give to a fox like me?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_fc1b8378:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/32 Daze ne znay.ogg"
    Ant "I don't know..."


translate english bunny2_cont1_8fbf60bf:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/32.2 No ya chital.ogg"
    Ant "But I've read about Alisa the fox."


translate english bunny2_cont1_99ecacc5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/104 A chto.ogg"
    Fox "You know what?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_11ccd93d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/105 Ya ne.ogg"
    Fox "I don't mind."


translate english bunny2_cont1_3d8cadc5:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/106 Pust budet.ogg"
    Alis "I'll be Alisa."


translate english bunny2_cont1_614e6e75:


    "I couldn't understand if she was joking or not."


translate english bunny2_cont1_f4f43e97:


    "I turned around, as if looking for an answer: from the dog, from the dark sky devoid of dawn."


translate english bunny2_cont1_a2237f2c:


    "My silent questions were left unanswered."


translate english bunny2_cont1_2e961d03:


    "The school's outline was already in our sight."


translate english bunny2_cont1_95aaf467:


    "A giant brick box, stuck in the endless night."


translate english bunny2_cont1_fccf13fc:


    "Lights in its windows didn't bode well for me."


translate english bunny2_cont1_222666fd:


    "The warden-trees were guarding the school yard."


translate english bunny2_cont1_181a77db:


    "Screams, childish laughter and someone's whistling tore up the silence."


translate english bunny2_cont1_ef50a5ef:


    "I went here with mom when we just moved and the place looked cozy at that time: empty corridors that smelled of polish, puffy snow outside..."


translate english bunny2_cont1_7c51940e:


    "The second time I came alone to get the books and just kept on imagining my peers, rolling down the railings, grade schoolers, running to the library, and teachers, marching down the corridor with the air of self-importance around them."


translate english bunny2_cont1_ee5e82d3:


    "High schoolers were smoking at the entrance, in track pants and wool caps, perched on their foreheads."


translate english bunny2_cont1_7536f11f:


    "Their appearance destroyed the last of hopes for a cozy school."


translate english bunny2_cont1_0f5bd0ee:


    "Their stingy eyes and the teeth, yellow from nicotine, their smirks: all of it had the same gloomy effect as the cloudy winter morning."


translate english bunny2_cont1_95048b38:


    "Absorbed by my thoughts, I completely forgot about my companion."


translate english bunny2_cont1_a89bf231:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/107 Posle.ogg"
    Alis "I'll wait for you at the back yard after school."


translate english bunny2_cont1_b5ef17ac:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/108 Vozle.ogg"
    Alis "Near the hanged man."


translate english bunny2_cont1_d568a13d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/033. Vozle kogo.ogg"
    Ant "Near what?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_93a786a5:


    "She just ignored my question."


translate english bunny2_cont1_e7f8449d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/109 Ne opazd.ogg"
    Alis "Don't be late."


translate english bunny2_cont1_e6ba0b58:


    "I hesitated."


translate english bunny2_cont1_5c2a4301:


    "\"Blowing hot and cold again\", Mom always said that when I would have trouble choosing between two options."


translate english bunny2_cont1_81776c54:


    "Thinking about mom helped me reply:"


translate english bunny2_cont1_8b1569eb:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/034. Ya posle shkoli.ogg"
    Ant "I'm going straight home after school."


translate english bunny2_cont1_33d65fc8:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/110 Eh.ogg"
    Alis "Well, Antosha, I'm going to let you off the hook."


translate english bunny2_cont1_b05ba69a:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/111 Drugie ze.ogg"
    Alis "But the others will creep up to you with their smiles and sink their teeth into you. Won't be able to shake them off as easily."


translate english bunny2_cont1_9a81bfca:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/112 Popomni.ogg"
    Alis "Remember my words."


translate english bunny2_cont1_dad2209d:


    "The fox opened her mouth in a wide yawn."


translate english bunny2_cont1_2756e5f7:


    "What kind of trick is this?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_ee0b4763:


    "Someone running in the distance called out my name."


translate english bunny2_cont1_f06d8671:


    "I instinctively turned around."


translate english bunny2_cont1_2bf8a4a8:


    "A huge snowball whizzed past my shoulder and hit the dog."


translate english bunny2_cont1_77c6cfb1:


    "It whimpered and ran toward the spring."


translate english bunny2_cont1_111157cd:


    "The darkness devoured it."


translate english bunny2_cont1_1b7dabba:


    "The fox girl was also nowhere to be seen. She dissolved into frosty air."


translate english bunny2_cont1_9abeaa76:


    "Or was she hiding in my shadow?"


translate english bunny2_cont1_71e470a7:


    "I gulped."


translate english bunny2_cont1_26093803:


    "And swallowed the gum."


translate english bunny2_cont1_82a498ad:


    "Unlucky."


translate english bunny2_cont1_5d487545:


    "After taking a deep breath, I went toward the school, toward the cutlets in dough, toward the light raining down onto the snow."


translate english bunny_school_night_gopniks_8e4ee35a:


    "A crowd of upperclassmen."


translate english bunny_school_night_gopniks_c88b3af6:


    "A buzzing crowd of upperclassmen with their winter hats tipped to the side. I'd better not draw their attention."


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_bf4c135f:


    "A black Volga."


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_f048a38e:


    "There was a fresh-looking Volga parked nearby, with one of its front wheels perched up on the icy kerb."


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_6139d581:


    "Black like sooth. As if it was straight out of the horror story dad loved to tell me when we hid in the attic during a thunderstorm."


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_5d70a0d4:


    "I remember him always wearing a sad smile while mentioning the black car that snatched children."


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_d6e9e5ae:


    "He would say:"


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_45ef1328:


    "\"It looks like a funeral car on the inside, white curtains and all.\""


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_90e42ab2:


    "\"And it has DSC in its license plate. Do you know what that means? Death to Soviet children.\""


translate english bunny_school_night_dog_d408c533:


    "Funny, I was born in the USSR too..."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_6c52b6a5:


    "A tall man was standing near the gate, puffing out clouds of smoke into the wind."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_f8cdae21:


    "He didn't look like a teacher."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_8a1b1ebc:


    "Was he a PE guy, maybe?"


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_02ac147c:


    "I carefully studied his face that looked like it was cut from a piece of granite and his hare lip that was holding down a cigarette."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_49d3ffd1:


    "He was playing around with car keys and staring back at us."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_bcfeb3d4:


    "The light from the cigarette was reflected in his eyes that were sitting deep in his eye sockets."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_8ca60f6e:


    "I froze in place."


translate english bunny_school_night_witness_32a666ca:


    "The hulking man lazily tore off his eyes from us and walked toward the road."


translate english bunny_school_night_nest_e0a5e08d:


    "A raven nest."


translate english bunny_school_night_nest_aea897a3:


    "Whose nest is this, I wonder?"


translate english bunny_school_night_nest_63acb064:


    "A thieving magpie?"


translate english bunny_school_night_nest_733c3ea6:


    "Then it probably has all sorts of shiny things in it."


translate english bunny_school_night_nest_30dc6a7e:


    "Pieces of colorful glass, bottle caps, polished coins... or child braces."


translate english total_test_8f7d9d7f:


    "I could hear muffled voices behind the doors. Saw blinking lamps."


translate english total_test_8c57e863:


    "Darkness creeped along the windows and it felt like the school was drifting in open space like a lonely, lost spaceship."


translate english total_test_977fcae1:


    "After going up to the second floor, I noticed a crowd around the notice board."


translate english total_test_2204d5cc:


    "Everyone was taking part in a lively discussion."


translate english total_test_3fece921:


    "I moved closer and took a look at something everyone was interested in through a wall of backpacks."


translate english total_test_8df279be:


    "There was a piece of paper with something printed on it glued to the left of the notice board."


translate english total_test_d52d886a:


    "\"Child missing!\""


translate english total_test_573c005f:


    "Vova Matyukhin. That was his name."


translate english total_test_3545f9f1:


    "A 4th grader."


translate english total_test_d5fd301f:


    "On that grainy print Vova looked dead, with a black mouth and dark, empty eye sockets."


translate english total_test_9c6325ec:


    "Could it be that the darkness dwelling deep in the forest invaded his pores and mutilated his face?"


translate english total_test_0b9abaf8:


    "A plastic toy gun couldn't protect him from the whispering branches and the howling wind."


translate english total_test_6d583564:


    "Empty eyes of the lost boy pierced through my soul, as if pleading."


translate english total_test_51c4fbba:


    "Unable to meet his stare, I turned around and rushed to the window. Took a seat on the windowsill."


translate english total_test_2f7c69df:


    "The corridor was slowly filling up with children, in groups of few."


translate english total_test_335938d4:


    "Nobody paid me any mind."


translate english total_test_fdeca0db:


    "In the darkness of school toilets child voices were hammering a nursery rhyme:"


translate english total_test_87b63541:



    voice "voice/Child/2day/Child_01.ogg"
    Childs "For the fox and for the bear, \nBunny tasty meals prepare!"


translate english total_test_a53b4ad7:


    "I turned my head toward them, trying to get a better look at their features, but then my attention was stolen by a loud clicking sound."


translate english total_test_978b3ec6:


    "A female teacher marched down the corridor, with her chin raised up high."


translate english total_test_41c76830:


    "Her heels were hitting the floor like miniature hooves."


translate english total_test_1cc27419:


    "A girl was trailing her every step."


translate english total_test_da48a8e9:


    "She was also looking pompous, stopping along the way and whispering some secret in her friend's ear."


translate english total_test_05d12286:


    "She was probably a class rep since she was carrying an attendance register book."


translate english total_test_eb0257f7:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/01 Ekaterina.ogg"
    Teacher "Ekaterina, take this, please."


translate english total_test_daa3b393:


    "The teacher opened the classroom door and the crowd of children swarmed in, screaming and pushing."


translate english total_test_0177291a:


    "Out of all of them, a tall redheaded fat boy caught my attention. His face was full of blisters, he looked like the insides of a pomegranate."


translate english total_test_c928b946:


    "A bad feeling risen up the hair on the back of my head."


translate english total_test_2131fce7:


    "I've seen boys like him before—unsettled eyes, cackling laughter."


translate english total_test_ecdbdb66:


    "The girl who was a smaller copy of the teacher warned the boy with a wave of her hand and entered the room through the clearing in the crowd."


translate english total_test_2fd6fefc:


    "Some other guy stood in the way of the crowd and the redhead immediately shoved him:"


translate english total_test_425cf901:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/01 Topa.ogg"
    Noname "Move your legs, moron!"


translate english total_test_5a53ca0f:


    "The boy flew headfirst, flailing his hands, trying to keep his balance."


translate english total_test_2e7a2e4a:


    "The fatso burst out laughing and a couple of kids joined his nasty cackling."


translate english total_test_3a469f16:


    "Their laughter sounded like someone was snipping with huge garden scissors."


translate english total_test_69c189cf:


    "The classroom sucked all of the kids in. The corridor stood empty."


translate english total_test_00da5ea2:


    "I wanted to grow roots and stay on the windowsill."


translate english total_test_6ed3f277:


    "Just a handful of lampposts outside were battling the darkness, writhing like fluorescent fish in the black ocean."


translate english total_test_a04ece92:


    "Maybe I can still run away?"


translate english total_test_04a90d9d:


    "Go outside, dissolve in the dark."


translate english total_test_d532a38f:


    "I imagined myself running through snow, how it squeaks under my boots, and how I'm becoming lighter and lighter with every step."


translate english total_test_cabbccc0:


    "The ringer's trill blew that illusion away."


translate english total_test_595543b6:


    "I tore myself from the window with great effort."


translate english total_test_99b5895f:


    "Then took a couple of deep breaths, trying to at least calm down my mad pulse, and entered the classroom."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_20abb2c8:


    "The prim teacher looked at me over the frame of her glasses, clearly annoyed."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_21f5e34e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/37 Ya novenkiy.ogg"
    Ant "I'm... the transfer student."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4d094841:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/37.2 Mne vot skazali.ogg"
    Ant "I was told to come here."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_6a422ec3:


    "The snowy forest trail was winding in front of my eyes. The pines rustled, but it didn't sound predatory anymore."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_f3fe97e5:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/02 Hm.ogg"
    Teacher "Hm..."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_905c25bb:


    "She buried herself in the register and flicked through the pages."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1be496a8:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/03 A fam.ogg"
    Teacher "Your last name?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_44e02a14:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/038. P-petrov.ogg"
    Ant "P-Petrov..."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4588e27b:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/04 Gromche.ogg"
    Teacher "Huh? What are you mumbling there?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_d4e69f0a:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/05 Chego.ogg"
    Teacher "Say it clearly!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_3e8850d8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/039. Petrov.ogg"
    Ant "Petrov!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_d5a4e171:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/06 Net.ogg"
    Teacher "Hm... You're not on the list."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_ca38f934:


    "She measured me with a long and heavy stare, as if trying to see if I was lying."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_5b0c65f4:


    "I wanted to sink through the floor."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_98d2c2e2:


    "Hazy faces observed all of that from the left. The classroom breathed and snorted in unison, like a living organism, like a dangerous beast."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_588a34e4:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/08 Ty ne.ogg"
    Teacher "Are you sure?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_c9172a76:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/09 Net takogo.ogg"
    Teacher "I don't have you in my register."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4f03fad1:


    "My knees chose the worst time to start shaking, and I felt dizzy."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_46af784e:


    "I clutched my fists so hard my knuckles became white."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_86aac762:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/040. Mne skazali 204.ogg"
    Ant "They told me to come to the classroom 204, to ask for Lilia Pavlovna, class 6-C."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_0f4d8e16:


    "Apparently everyone in the classroom took my words for some sort of joke, because they were all laughing."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_01d96308:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/10 Chto za.ogg"
    Teacher "What's wrong with this school?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_3a621d46:


    "The classroom fell silent."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_b5125474:


    "The kids hid their smirks for a better occasion."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_a94dc9b7:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/11 Ponaberut.ogg"
    Teacher "Why do we hire so many interns?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_a85f7b92:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/12 Tolko.ogg"
    Teacher "They all know know how to put lipstick all over their bulging lips, but when it comes to real problems, I have to solve everything!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4cdcfaa4:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/13 A bumagi.ogg"
    Teacher "How did they send you here without any proper paperwork? Ugh, we've had this same thing happen so many times already."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_37512f7b:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/14 Podozdi.ogg"
    Teacher "Wait here. I'll be back..."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_b5e1fae1:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/15 Seychas.ogg"
    Teacher "After I have a little chat with them."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1d596fb0:


    "The teacher flew past me, mumbling something to herself in righteous anger, and I was left standing at the center of the classroom."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_f7312241:


    "Like a convict in front of a firing squad. I lowered my gaze, feeling the mocking stares from all around the classroom directed at me."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_e61b070d:


    "They prickled my skin, danced on it like laser sights."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1793a86b:


    "Once again, I imagined running far away from this place, fighting the clawing wind, soaring high above the pines in one long jump."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_8fb0145a:


    "With the wind in my back as my only companion."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_3e90f530:


    "The eyes of my future classmates were asking: \"This new boy — is he one of us or an outsider?\""


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_cfe63c7b:


    "Somebody whispered something and stifled laughter rolled through the classroom."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_48830d25:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/03 Dosk.ogg"
    Noname "Wipe the board!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_2fc8a06e:


    "It was easy to guess who was the main prankster here."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_48ace0d8:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/04 Ei.ogg"
    Noname "Hey, four-eyes!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_d5ccdfb5:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/05 Ty cz.ogg"
    Noname "Are you not only blind, but also deaf?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_8c8df63b:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/06 Dosk.ogg"
    Noname "I said! Wipe the board!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_738b68c7:


    "My knees weren't the only shaking part of my body anymore."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_9e7bf20d:


    "I was trembling from head to toe, and I prayed for the teacher to come back sooner."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_b17ebba1:


    "My prayers were answered by the powers that be."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_c431201d:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/17 Nu chto.ogg"
    Teacher "And what should I do with you now?!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1b081236:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/18 Kuda saj.ogg"
    Teacher "Where will you sit?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_958539b7:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/19 Davai-ka.ogg"
    Teacher "Oh well, you can sit with Semyon, I guess."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_fdd0734e:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/20 On vse.ogg"
    Teacher "He's alone anyway."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_08f24a18:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/07 Escze.ogg"
    Sem "No way!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_7828fab5:


    "The fatso put his backpack on the seat beside him in defiance, scratched his belly and smirked."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_d1577ab3:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/21 Ti opyat.ogg"
    Teacher "Are you back to your old tricks?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_0114a185:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/22 Snova.ogg"
    Teacher "Should I call your grandma here again?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_27854818:


    "The classroom went silent."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_13f34d07:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/09 A cze.ogg"
    Sem "And what she's gonna do?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_7900e344:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/23 Ne ona.ogg"
    Teacher "I'll be the one to do something if she doesn't."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_459724b8:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/24 Bag.ogg"
    Teacher "Put away your backpack, now!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_935dd0b2:


    "Semyon didn't move a muscle."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_ebf7a471:


    "He started studying the portraits of writers on the wall, looking bored."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_166f9191:


    "I needed to do something, to resolve this somehow. To save myself."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_7e70797b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/41 Ya.ogg"
    Ant "I..."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_2840248c:


    "I cleared my throat and continued in a stifled voice, that sounded nothing like me:"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_a6a43aca:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/42.2 Ya mogu za posl.ogg"
    Ant "I can sit in the last row."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4c50fa35:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/42.3 Tam kazetsa.ogg"
    Ant "I think there's a free seat."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1849e564:


    "The teacher snorted loudly."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_339e9ac4:


    "She looked at me, then at Semyon, then back at me."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4d0a40b5:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/26 Ladno.ogg"
    Teacher "Fine, go there for now."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_d9623b27:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/27 A s toboy.ogg"
    Teacher "And you, Baburin... I'll have a talk with you later!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_5f5953f2:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/28 Chtobi.ogg"
    Teacher "Come to me after classes."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_7211a89f:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/29 Budesh.ogg"
    Teacher "You'll be on cleaning duty. Got it?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_001c0804:


    "Semyon forced out a twisted smile. Juicy pimples were growing on the tip of his nose, ripe for the taking."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_eb86836b:


    "I walked carefully, afraid to stumble and fall, causing another outburst of laughter from everyone."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_f732acfb:


    "I took my seat at the back, at the last table, where I was met with a pile of old posters."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_5268be80:


    "The outcasts took their seats and the class was ready to start."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_b08ae83c:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/30 Vot i.ogg"
    Teacher "Now this is settled, let's start the class!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1d429e67:



    voice "voice/lydia/2day/31 Tema.ogg"
    Teacher "Today's theme is traditions of Russian and international literature in Zoshenko's 'Don't lie'."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_47fc7fb6:


    "The fatso turned back to me. His stare informed me of the coming days, weeks and months of bullying."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_9c7aa603:


    "\"I've got my eyes on you\", said his watery look."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_45b3c192:


    "After just a couple of periods I had already noticed a huge yellow spit stain in my notebook."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_c1bae452:


    "Then, at the cafeteria, this Semyon \"accidentally\" spilled a glass of {u}kompot{/u} on me."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_dd950d97:


    "And then he flailed his hands around after exiting the toilet so some of the liquid from his hands would get on me."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_a89adfd3:


    "Just before the final period for today, Semyon pushed me into a buzzing crowd of girls from our class."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_127ec896:


    "They made way, cursing, but I couldn't hold my balance and ended up ramming my face into the girl I took for the class rep before. Right in her chest."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_0cf0b377:



    voice "voice/kate/04 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Ow!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_75713efb:


    "I immediately stepped back, dying from embarrassment."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_93b8f62f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/043. Prosti ti v.ogg"
    Ant "I'm sorry, are you alright?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_4fa29942:


    Kate "I..."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_14237df4:


    "Then she suddenly put her hands on her hips."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_1aca1a47:



    voice "voice/kate/06 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Will you look at him!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_28d02167:



    voice "voice/kate/07 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Groping me in front of everyone!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_f5ce3c05:



    voice "voice/kate/08 KA.ogg"
    Kate "I'll tell my mom!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_e116d69b:



    voice "voice/kate/09 KA.ogg"
    Kate "They'll expel you, pervert!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_df57f5d7:


    "There was some sort of sadistic pleasure in her eyes, as if she was a child who was about to put a lit up match to the chafer beetle."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_ac4f308e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/044. Ya nechayanno.ogg"
    Ant "I didn't mean to! He pushed me..."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_c66340cd:



    voice "voice/kate/10 KA.ogg"
    Kate "We all saw that, you know! No blind among us!"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_977b7ce1:


    "She stared at my glasses while showing me a creepy smile."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_d8b383cf:


    "I started to fume on the inside, but Semyon's laughter cooled my head."


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_eb624fc8:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/10 Tolk.ogg"
    Sem "I pushed you? You sure?"


translate english bunny2_school_classroom1_75e51d5b:


    "He swaggered up to me, enveloping me in the smell of sunflower seeds and rotting teeth, and then pushed me to the ground."


translate english bunny_day2_semen_a1e509c9:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/11 Vot.ogg"
    Sem "Like this, huh? Whatcha gonna do now?"


translate english bunny_day2_semen_3f2cc123:


    "The bully towered over me, as if saying:"


translate english bunny_day2_semen_5fb007a3:


    "\"Come on! Hit me! Lemme see you try!\""


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_2cae11ee:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/048. Slushai ti.ogg"
    Ant "Listen, you..."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_036aa548:


    "My throat went dry, my lips were moving on their own, and my voice was akin to a stifled squeal."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_334c0df1:


    "Semyon wore a mocking smile."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_8baaf7c0:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/12 Dava.ogg"
    Sem "Go on, four-eyes."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_20da7407:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/13 CZo p.ogg"
    Sem "Why did you stop?"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_774aaf5e:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/14 Nam.ogg"
    Sem "We're all waiting."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_4f95a321:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/049. Esle eshe hot raz.ogg"
    Ant "If you ever touch me again..."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_650a4cdb:


    "Semyon slowly stuck out a finger and poked my forehead."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_0df377f4:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/15 Nu t.ogg"
    Sem "I did, so what?"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_81aa11d2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/50.1Eshohotraz.ogg"
    Ant "If you ever do it again..."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_9ed44231:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/16 Tron.ogg"
    Sem "Here."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_b4d52d12:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/17 A vo.ogg"
    Sem "Once more."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_534ec0ef:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/18 I escz.ogg"
    Sem "And again!"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_b21cff91:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/19 I escz.ogg"
    Sem "And again!"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_cd1fd502:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/20 I escz.ogg"
    Sem "And again!"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_37aaa9f7:


    "He was poking me with his finger so hard that my head tilted backward."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_e5108d03:


    "I must not cry."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_738c095e:


    "Or I'll be done for!"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_1ed733dd:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/21 CZe t.ogg"
    Sem "What will a wimp like you do to me?"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_1a27b109:


    "My vision went blurry."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_737035c8:


    "My soles tore off from the floor."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_9069e541:


    "I rushed forward and threw a random punch without looking."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_c20ea4c3:


    "What I saw when I opened my eyes was beautiful and horrifying at the same time."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_6892a9c4:


    "Semyon was holding his ear and blinking in amazement."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_348a606c:


    "Was I the first person to rebel against his absolute rule?"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_2a160f10:


    "I needed to run but I was already surrounded by his cronies."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_bc73e961:



    voice "voice/kate/11 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Lilia Pavlovna!"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_27681eb9:



    voice "voice/kate/12 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Lilia Pavlovna, Petrov just hit Baburin!"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_1961be53:


    "Semyon's cheeks grew even redder and his pimples even whiter, like the heads of larvae."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_fc0d7c21:


    "But a smile flashed on his face, that was only noticed among his comrades."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_e968ad13:


    "He got really close to me. The smell of rotten teeth washed over me."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_191ea168:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/23 Tebe.ogg"
    Sem "You..."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_9eb649ab:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/24 Pizd.ogg"
    Sem "...are fucking done."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_856169be:


    "His voice was evil and dangerous, like someone tore off the lid from a kettle with boiling fat."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_b48a278a:


    "I was waiting to get hit."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_a624da6c:


    "Counting the thumps of my heart and guessing where his fist will go."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_56050602:


    "The solar plexus? The jaw? The nose?"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_729b62ba:


    "But he just turned around and walked off."


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_defd716c:


    "A thought, cold and sober, and extremely rational, popped up in my head:"


translate english bunny2_semen_fight_ffb84a00:


    "I'm going to get killed today."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_9611ee70:


    "I was late to leave the school after classes on purpose."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_2f4a059f:


    "Semyon didn't attend the last period, so I was hopeful: what if he decided to dodge the cleaning duty and ran home, forgetting all about me?"


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_bc34d2e6:


    "I heaved a sigh of relief, like someone on death row whose execution was delayed by a day."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_9ff06f1f:


    "But I didn't let myself forget his tone, his vengeful gaze and his scary, electrified smirk."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_2acfe66b:


    "This was a relief. I didn't want to meet him in the empty hallway."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_ebdf6de6:


    "The smirks of my classmates stood before my eyes like overturned horseshoes."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_2d726005:


    "My class had a lot of fun at my expense, but those who missed the show were asking the others to describe my bullying in full detail."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_3f59d217:


    "I should've just transferred into a school for freaks. I'd be less conspicuous amongst hunchbacks, lame-legged and disfigured."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_1c0ded8b:


    "While the other students were leaving the school, laughing loudly, I was pretending to skim through my books near a window."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_81f5d08b:


    "I was staring outside, nervous."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_daf0a700:


    "Semyon was nowhere to be found in the front yard or near the school gate."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_5a69387d:


    "I didn't really believe I was this lucky, so I decided to be extra cautious and stayed for some more time in the corridor that was gradually getting less crowded."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_97e33ae6:


    "All of the bustle moved to the first floor."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_4fabbc14:


    "There was a skeleton, peeking out of the biology classroom. Some jokester put a cap with the American condor on its head."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_1fe84169:


    "The sound of running water were coming from the bathroom."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_34ac41ac:


    "I was the only person left in the whole school."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_42c800a0:


    "\"I'm not alone!\", a sudden thought came to mind."


translate english bunny2_meet_pol_03cb6c63:


    "I remembered the missing boy. His portrait was on the notice board, near the schedule."


translate english test_polina_42c6ff1d:


    "I remembered his smile..."


translate english test_polina_006de54d:


    "...him looking at me..."


translate english test_polina_5f0e7666:


    "...and the fact that he's mostly likely already dead."


translate english test_polina_5b6dc0fa:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/1 Privet.ogg"
    Noname "Hello!" with vpunch


translate english test_polina_e78a7c0b:


    "I shuddered and turned around."


translate english test_polina_c8be7c34:


    "At first my eyes stumbled upon the black violin case."


translate english doehal_1_77843044:


    "Then I noticed a girl from my class was holding it."


translate english doehal_1_6a66d915:


    "She sat in the first row of the second column. I could swear I caught her looking at me a couple of times."


translate english doehal_1_2ca6bee0:


    "And I was sneaking glances at her myself."


translate english doehal_1_948d3bb9:


    "Sometimes it just feels nice to look at something pretty: the spring, the sky or a girl that's not in the crowd that laughs at Semyon's jokes."


translate english doehal_1_02e6a478:


    "And she wasn't whispering the dirty laundry of other people to Katya."


translate english doehal_1_744ef1ba:


    "She spent all the breaks just like me—staying in the classroom or looking in the window or drawing something in her green notebook."


translate english doehal_1_ec44091a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/052. Zdravstvui.ogg"
    Ant "Hello!"


translate english doehal_1_b6acc600:


    "I turned red and pretended I was studying the pattern on the wooden floor."


translate english doehal_1_0fb5d652:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/02 Kruto ti emu.ogg"
    Noname "It was cool, the way you hit him!"


translate english doehal_1_ec630a39:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/053.Eto vishlo slych.ogg"
    Ant "It was just an accident. Almost."


translate english doehal_1_d7c3947a:


    "I started shoving books in my backpack, to at least put something in my hands."


translate english doehal_1_fa85fc10:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/40 Ya videka.ogg"
    Noname "I saw Baburin push you."


translate english doehal_1_1f034e16:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/41 Ti v poryadke.ogg"
    Noname "Are you alright?"


translate english doehal_1_082addb0:


    "The bump on my head hurt, but it wasn't all that, much uncomfortable."


translate english doehal_1_16f67fe6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Vporyadke.ogg"
    Ant "I'm fine."


translate english doehal_1_d452eb08:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Pustyak.ogg"
    Ant "It's nothing."


translate english doehal_1_460ff58e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/42 Aga.ogg"
    Noname "It's definitely not nothing!"


translate english doehal_1_76483979:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/43 Etot.ogg"
    Noname "That idiot can't control himself at all lately."


translate english doehal_1_606adcc2:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/44 Vrezal.ogg"
    Noname "You should've punched him back."


translate english doehal_1_2331f9a0:


    "I mumbled in reply."


translate english doehal_1_c8e43769:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/03 Vrode semen.ogg"
    Noname "Semyon wasn't like that before."


translate english doehal_1_2cfbc2bf:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/04 On k nam.ogg"
    Noname "He also transferred here just recently."


translate english doehal_1_b5901d25:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/05 Babushka.ogg"
    Noname "His grandma told me that it almost felt like he went mad..."


translate english doehal_1_c0809c35:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/06 Semena daze.ogg"
    Noname "Even the upperclassmen fear Semyon, did you know?"


translate english doehal_1_8ff06ee5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/07 A ti vot.ogg"
    Noname "But you're different."


translate english doehal_1_bf535004:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/08 Ne strusil.ogg"
    Noname "You're brave."


translate english doehal_1_2331f9a0_1:


    "I mumbled in reply."


translate english doehal_1_ec98f73e:


    "Yeah, right. Me, brave?"


translate english doehal_1_bcbfd781:


    "A hero that has been standing around in the hallway to avoid a beating."


translate english doehal_1_d7c3947a_1:


    "I started shoving books in my backpack, to at least put something in my hands."


translate english doehal_1_77cf359a:


    "The girl looked at me with her clear, attentive eyes."


translate english doehal_1_14d6dbdc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/09 A ti za rekoi.ogg"
    Noname "Do you live over the river?"


translate english doehal_1_72e23da9:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/10 V tom dome.ogg"
    Noname "In that wooden house?"


translate english doehal_1_85ec85e1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/055. Nu da.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah..."


translate english doehal_1_5a305d38:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/11 Tam navernoe.ogg"
    Noname "Must be scary living there."


translate english doehal_1_2ad71960:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/11 Da esche.ogg"
    Noname "And you also have to cross the forest..."


translate english doehal_1_23a7a60a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/12 Ya bi tak.ogg"
    Noname "I wouldn't be able to do that."


translate english doehal_1_8d60e38f:


    "I shivered at the mention of the forest."


translate english doehal_1_5f90f5d7:


    "I thought of intertwining branches, of a snake-like trail, of endless darkness that spread like mold among the crooked trees."


translate english doehal_1_fa8138ea:


    "So I straight up lied:"


translate english doehal_1_16f0d2d2:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/56 Da ne tak uzh.ogg"
    Ant "It's not that scary."


translate english doehal_1_427f3bfd:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/56.2 A chto tebya.ogg"
    Ant "What's so scary about it for you?"


translate english doehal_1_62a45ecc:


    "She smiled after a brief pause."


translate english doehal_1_8354c230:


    "As if brushing off a daydream."


translate english doehal_1_35e2a47b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/13 Da tak.ogg"
    Noname "Well... actually, never mind."


translate english doehal_1_5003b418:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/14 Menya kstati.ogg"
    Noname "My name is Polina, by the way."


translate english doehal_1_5d2b690d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/057. A menya Anton.ogg"
    Ant "And I'm Anton."


translate english doehal_1_d5186d42:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/15 Nu eto ya znayu.ogg"
    Pol "I already know that."


translate english doehal_1_a309072a:


    Pol "..."


translate english doehal_1_f13fc8b4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/16 Slushai.ogg"
    Pol "Hey, Anton..."


translate english doehal_1_1ae1c214:


    "She stumbled, as if trying to decide whether she should continue."


translate english doehal_1_53327191:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/17 A chto ti.ogg"
    Pol "What are you doing after school?"


translate english doehal_1_774ec3d5:


    "My chest felt prickly after her innocent question, yet somehow it felt pleasant."


translate english doehal_1_aea8a46d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/058. Nichego takogo.ogg"
    Ant "Nothing much..."


translate english doehal_1_9ce490d6:


    "I stumbled and didn't finish my sentence."


translate english doehal_1_3d4cf095:


    "Alisa's predatory smile flashed in front of my eyes."


translate english doehal_1_368f3b93:


    "Her playful eyes in the slits of the mask were probably just a product of my imagination, though."


translate english doehal_1_b68a4c1a:


    "What if that fox girl is waiting for me after the school?"


translate english doehal_1_f36f4914:


    "Or was it another of her weird jokes?"


translate english doehal_1_f796dfbf:


    "I wonder if she's hiding a big red tail under her coat?"


translate english doehal_1_e8ceb904:


    "I suddenly got covered with beads of sweat, like after a PE class."


translate english doehal_1_2f9856e1:


    "I wanted to take a shower, as if just thinking of the foxy girl made me dirty, soiled my clothes, lured me into the forest's embrace."


translate english doehal_1_281cd472:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/18 Y meanya seychas.ogg"
    Pol "I have a violin lesson and then I'll be free."


translate english doehal_1_738ff75a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/19 Ded mne.ogg"
    Pol "My grandpa hired me a private tutor."


translate english doehal_1_98164afb:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/20 Nash uchitel.ogg"
    Pol "Our music teacher is a violinist and he doesn't have anyone to teach here... except for me."


translate english doehal_1_7fcde81a:


    "She waved her free hand in the air, imitating the movement of a bow on violin strings."


translate english doehal_1_01da2f8d:


    "I could almost hear the music."


translate english doehal_1_27248510:


    "It chased Alisa out of my head."


translate english doehal_1_75ccaaa4:


    "I looked at Polina's lips, catching her every word, and was frozen from the unusual sensations."


translate english doehal_1_787f6563:


    "They were warm, soothing."


translate english doehal_1_43f479d6:


    "And tingly."


translate english doehal_1_143de9e3:


    "It felt like I was very small and the feelings were immense and they couldn't fit inside me."


translate english doehal_1_713bb406:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/21 Tut govoryat.ogg"
    Pol "They say there's a serial killer on the lose in the village."


translate english doehal_1_2bbb6461:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/22 Ranshe.ogg"
    Pol "Normally grandpa would escort me home from school, but he's been sick lately."


translate english doehal_1_dcf4d5b8:


    "I snuck a glance at Vova's photo."


translate english doehal_1_31d01f39:


    "His eyewells were studying me, his lips were wearing black lipstick."


translate english doehal_1_01421e0f:


    "Just like the portrait on a gravestone."


translate english doehal_1_9842b712:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/24 Ti ne.ogg"
    Pol "I mean, I'm not a coward, it's just..."


translate english doehal_1_1771d8a1:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/25 Prosto mne.ogg"
    Pol "I think I'll be safer together with you."


translate english doehal_1_3df0c262:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/26 Anton ti.ogg"
    Pol "Will you go home with me, Anton?"


translate english doehal_1_ed0f5016:


    "There it was!"


translate english doehal_1_e607107a:


    "Finally, everything that I read about in the adventure books, everything that I dreamt about was seeping into my life..."


translate english doehal_1_1dbb5584:


    "A mysterious crime, a beautiful stranger and a heroic duel."


translate english doehal_1_f25a4311:


    "A duel..."


translate english doehal_1_2bebbff2:


    "Thinking of Semyon instantly sobered me up, returned me back to earth, and it started shaking under my feet like a deck of a ship."


translate english doehal_1_0c8584af:


    "If only I could rise to the occasion in front of Polina."


translate english doehal_1_24432b60:


    "Because no matter how brave I was trying to act, it was obvious for both of us that I wouldn't be able to stand a chance against a big guy like that."


translate english doehal_1_ac3de96a:


    "And him knocking me out won't even be the worst of it."


translate english doehal_1_7311f11b:


    "The worst part is that Polina will see all of that."


translate english doehal_1_6eadd510:


    "And she'll laugh at me like everybody else..."


translate english doehal_1_4373a861:


    "No, I don't need anybody to see me in such a shameful state."


translate english doehal_1_eaeae510:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/59 Segonya vryad li.ogg"
    Ant "I doubt I'll be able to today."


translate english doehal_1_c0c1b440:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/59.2 You know.ogg"
    Ant "You know, Semyon is waiting for me outside."


translate english doehal_1_8cd54096:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/60. Better mne.ogg"
    Ant "I need to deal with him one on one, like a man."


translate english doehal_1_bb0bbf07:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/27 Gluposti kakie.ogg"
    Pol "Nonsense."


translate english doehal_1_7a6d859a:


    "Polina brushed off some hair off her forehead and I sensed a weak aroma of blackberry."


translate english doehal_1_241347bd:


    "Polina was like water when you were thirsty, you gulp it down and still wanted more."


translate english doehal_1_9ba6540f:


    "I remembered the summer evenings at the country house, the fire's pungent smoke, the berries, hanging over our fence from the neighbors, and a soft cover of pine needles under my soles."


translate english doehal_1_62ffa3d8:


    "Those few peaceful days when I felt completely safe."


translate english doehal_1_d680be66:


    "My mom, resting in the hammock, my dad — putting meat on a skewer."


translate english doehal_1_bcaef86f:


    "Could have I foreseen the upcoming catastrophe in the crackle of the coals, in our parents' laughs, in the smell of the fleeting July?"


translate english doehal_1_01793e98:


    "Could I have seen how fragile that world was?"


translate english doehal_1_72409e26:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/28 Dumaesh.ogg"
    Pol "Do you really think that savage will give you a fair fight?"


translate english doehal_1_0f3a0e94:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/29 So svoimi.ogg"
    Pol "He'll just swarm you with his friends, without giving you a chance to catch a breath."


translate english doehal_1_b69404b0:


    "Polina suddenly flashed a devious smile."


translate english doehal_1_6f23d1fc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/30 No esli mi.ogg"
    Pol "But if we go together, they will be put off."


translate english doehal_1_8ca7b144:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/31 Ya ze ne tolko.ogg"
    Pol "I'm not only the first violin of this village, I'm also a girl!"


translate english doehal_1_3f525a87:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/32 Slishala.ogg"
    Pol "I've heard from a delinquent I know that he'll never attack someone when there's a girl around."


translate english doehal_1_53d5e758:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/33 Predstavlyaesh.ogg"
    Pol "Can you imagine? They have this weird code of honor!"


translate english doehal_1_cc5f8c38:


    "\"A delinquent you know?\", I thought, worried."


translate english doehal_1_eba80c9d:


    "Is he better than me? Taller, more handsome?"


translate english doehal_1_312de3fc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/34 Oi mne.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, I have to go to music class."


translate english doehal_1_922e2192:


    "She made a couple of steps and stopped."


translate english doehal_1_b5f7d4c1:


    "Amazing... Polina didn't look like those beauties from the magazine posters or the actresses from the movies."


translate english doehal_1_3c44a57d:


    "But in the flickering light of the ceiling lamps she looked much more alluring."


translate english doehal_1_7853fe0f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/35 A ti.ogg"
    Pol "Can you play anything?"


translate english doehal_1_7cde66ed:


    "My parents bought me a guitar a couple of years ago."


translate english doehal_1_b46d39cf:


    "I immediately remembered my meager attempts at making music."


translate english doehal_1_477b4ec2:


    "Am-Em... Change, we're all waiting for change..."


translate english doehal_1_678e6540:


    "{u}Tsoy's{/u} song echoed my thoughts and my desire to change something."


translate english doehal_1_5141b18b:


    "That guitar got lost somewhere, as if refusing to move to the old house near the forest."


translate english doehal_1_5182a5f1:


    "I think my parents gave it away to someone that needed it more."


translate english doehal_1_e83ac275:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/61. Uvy ne.ogg"
    Ant "I don't, sadly."


translate english doehal_1_fa83e76c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/36 Eh.ogg"
    Pol "A pity."


translate english doehal_1_41d966d8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/37 Nu ladno.ogg"
    Pol "Oh well. I'll be going."


translate english doehal_1_c424224f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/38 Poka.ogg"
    Pol "Bye!"


translate english doehal_1_292d00a7:


    "Her shout was captured by the loud echo."


translate english doehal_1_328deaa0:


    "Her shoes also echoed through the school hallways."


translate english doehal_1_41ef594c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/62.Poka.ogg"
    Ant "Bye."


translate english doehal_1_6e49bc48:


    "I wasn't sure if Polina heard me."


translate english doehal_1_97afc316:


    "I looked out the window again."


translate english doehal_1_98d42e8d:


    "The school yard was empty — just a couple of grade schoolers throwing snowballs at each other."


translate english doehal_1_e15d462b:


    "Nobody who looked like the hulking Semyon with his cronies."


translate english doehal_1_2b403ae7:


    "This was giving me hope."


translate english doehal_1_bafaa53a:


    "What should I do?"


translate english doehal_1_59bb6cd1:


    "Polina could become my friend — the first one in this new place!"


translate english doehal_1_9cea7441:


    "And besides, she may be in real danger of meeting a killer and I'll be her defender, her knight..."


translate english doehal_1_e33c60fd:


    "And even though my inner voice was hesitant and whispered about running — away from the killers, lurking in the woods at night."


translate english doehal_1_8715fa8d:


    "Polina was worth the risk."


translate english doehal_1_c4229e8b:


    "But the red cunning fox was also intriguing."


translate english doehal_1_357f744e:


    "She promised me to help look for Vova, and this will bring me a reward."


translate english doehal_1_ecb34966:


    "More money will almost guarantee peace in my family."


translate english doehal_1_f72825f8:


    "Gifts for Olya..."


translate english doehal_1_70d4b1df:


    "I imagined my sister, happy like those girls who get prizes from {u}Suponev{/u} in the \"Finest hour\"."


translate english doehal_1_c9fa5e5f:


    "She'll be dancing with the famous singers, maybe a new popular boys band like {u}Ivanushki International{/u}."


translate english doehal_1_8d33f57b:


    "Mom and dad, hugging in the Ostankino pavilion."


translate english polfox_test_5db2a3d1:


    "And then all of us going to Disneyland."


translate english bucket_see_fd226cd4:


    "An abandoned zinc bucket with a rag on the bottom of it, filled to the brim with murky tap water."


translate english bucket_see_da4be1ad:


    "It reeked of salty chemicals and the stench was so intense that I felt sick. I staggered away from it, praying that I don't meet the same fate as the person on cleaning duty."


translate english bucket_see_c72bdb8a:


    "A smelly bucket."


translate english airplane_see_0b81c32f:


