translate english airplane_see_89827d33:


    "I wonder how long would Semyon keep turning it around if it fell into his hands?"


translate english airplane_see_5d5a5d17:


    "A paper plane."


translate english shoes_see_9445ba4f:


    "Somebody left their school shoes on the windowsill. Judging from their size, they belonged to a boy my age."


translate english shoes_see_5598add4:


    "School shoes."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_2a12072d:


    "After closing my backpack, I ran down the stairs."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_eb01af05:


    "I scanned my surroundings through the window in the main hall."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_ec60805a:


    "Nobody suspicious in sight."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_d18c62cf:


    "The school doors creaked. The sound was similar to the music from a thriller. The high note that comes before an intense scene."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_b3d2144e:


    "I ran around the school corner, trying not to catch anyone's attention."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_91d5e0fc:


    "The smell of pastry and burnt sugar wafted from the school cafeteria."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_194e5258:


    "I froze when I saw a silhouette in the second-floor window: it must be Polina, gliding a bow on violin strings, with her head slightly tilted to the side."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_b853592c:


    "I wish I could hear the melody she played, but Polina was only a dark outline on the window's yellow sheet."


translate english bunny2_fox_win_f345bfff:


    "I dragged my feet forward."


translate english bunny2_school_near2_73325047:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Ezvinite.ogg"
    Ant "E-excuse me?"


translate english bunny2_school_near2_2870004b:


    "The silhouette turned around the corner and walked deeper into the dead end."


translate english bunny2_school_near2_584bf47b:


    "Leaving cigarette smoke in its wake."


translate english bunny2_school_near2_14d3bd17:


    "It was an adult. A teacher, maybe?"


translate english bunny2_school_near4_410836a0:


    "Hanged man."


translate english bunny2_school_near4_6e7afd0a:


    "I looked at the wall: there was a hanged man drawn under the thin black line of resin."


translate english bunny2_school_near4_75b50baa:


    "Someone played the \"hangman\" here."


translate english bunny2_school_near4_4b029d01:


