translate english bunny2_school_near4_b2bdc362:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/114 Blize.ogg"
    Noname "Come closer, sweetheart..."


translate english bunny2_school_near4_11183ab1:


    "It took me a while to realize where the sound was coming from."


translate english bunny2_school_near4_d5b1380a:


    "My eyes strolled through the coul-de-sac at the school back yard, through windows and snow."


translate english bunny2_school_near5_b1502ab3:


    "Syringe."


translate english bunny2_school_near5_396c79ff:


    "A used syringe among the cigarette butts... I hope somebody just needed an insulin shot."


translate english bunny2_school_near6_c946d655:


    "Squirrel."


translate english bunny2_school_near6_79b60857:


    "A forest squirrel, chomping on sunflower seeds. Someone from the school is probably feeding her. Interesting."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_c7bf2262:


    "One of the snow piles started trembling, like a volcano before it erupts."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_0483c714:


    Alis "Give me your heart!"


translate english bunny2_school_near1_6c2e8ee6:


    "In the blink of an eye, the white crust crumbled and a fox jumped at me."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_20c9ecfd:


    "She made a gracious bow, enjoying the effect her appearance had on me."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_535b7487:


    "The silver of snow shined on her coat."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_65816506:


    "I couldn't even imagine that thinking about girls with tails can be this... I don't know what to compare it to."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_29a5c9af:


    "Something infectious? Toxically sweet?"


translate english bunny2_school_near1_fb00d248:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/116 Otpor.ogg"
    Alis "Fight back, or your heart is in my bag!"


translate english bunny2_school_near1_32ca8c7c:


    "She giggled so enthusiastically that it forced me to smile."


