    voice "voice/anton/2day/63. Da nu tebya.ogg"
    Ant "Oh, come on!"


translate english bunny2_school_near1_4b3c017d:


    "I quickly rolled a ball of snow and threw it at Alisa."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_37f306de:


