translate english bunny2_school_near1_8fcd5ab7:


    "Her retribution was swift — a snowball arched its way above the snowy yard and the ravens flying in the air."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_1ee61357:


    "I wanted to duck but slipped and fell to my knees."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_97b732c4:


    "And while I was getting up, I caught a huge chunk of snow with my face. It burned up from the cold."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_114ae85f:


    "I swore loudly from immense disappointment."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_aad7e231:


