translate english bunny2_school_near1_d2a446a9:


    "I faked a laugh in reply, unsure whether being able to move parts of her mask like that was genuinely funny or not."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_368edce2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/131 Nu ze.ogg"
