    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/133 I esli.ogg"
    Alis "And if you win..."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_9cdff5b8:


    "The fox girl got dangerously close to me and stood on her tip-toes, almost touching my face with her rough little nose."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_c8908314:


    "Playful fires danced deep in her eyes."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_530a3911:


    "She smelled nice, like berries in saccharine."


translate english bunny2_school_near1_ca698964:


