translate english test_run_a1b85339:


    "The sky really did disappear under the trees."


translate english test_run_7061ea8b:


    "I moved using the barking of Zhulka as a guide, since she was closely following her owner."


translate english test_run_47fb37d1:


    "And I was getting closer."


translate english test_run_4c8e2052:


    "And the same trail I imagined back at school blinked under my feet."


translate english test_run_264369b8:


