translate english test_run_a845c83a:


    "{i}Faster! Higher! Faster!{/i}"


translate english test_run_61d0082a:


    "I felt like there was a well of untapped potential inside me and I drew from it."


translate english test_run_b9169049:


    "My muscles were buzzing, my lungs felt bigger, and I felt much stronger overall."


translate english test_run_f8bb7afc:


    "Even my vision became sharper: I saw every icy branch, every dent in the bark."


translate english test_run_ce8a5dc4:


    "Something colorful was lying near the bushes — a piece of clothing."


translate english test_run_1bd54c85:


    "Another colorful spot to the right."


translate english test_run_4b8fef78:


    "Alisa was losing her clothes on the run. Like shedding her skin."


translate english test_run_e373b83d:


    "I also used my teeth to take off my mittens, excited by all that."


translate english test_run_af701ada:


    "I'll get naked and feel all the wind to the last drop!"


translate english test_run_c5ccb7f9:


    "{i}Faster!!!{/i}"


translate english test_run_5aca3243:


    "I reached out to take off my hat, to throw away everything that stops me from running wild in this endless forest."


translate english test_run_500e4f3f:


    "The backpack slowed me down, so I threw it in the snow along with all the pens that were inside, with all the notebooks, all of my drawings on the sidelines and a dinosaur for Olya..."


translate english test_run_149abfac:


    "Olya"


translate english test_run_e73b3120:


    "Suddenly, a clear picture appeared in my mind:"


translate english test_run_ba3ff56a:


    "My sister, standing still near a window, basking in the dusking sun."


translate english test_run_7337e379:


    "Her small childish palms are pressed to the glass, leaving marks when they warmed it up."


translate english test_run_a6c950d9:


    "She could warm up the whole world like that."


translate english test_run_bb24a80e:


    "She's looking at the taiga and saying my name."


