translate english test_run_634a6664:


    "I stopped, took a deep breath and realized how rash and stupid I was, trying to undress in the middle of a forest while chasing a fox..."


translate english test_run_676f115d:


    "I returned to get my backpack, as if it was a part of my being I dropped."


translate english test_run_4a40e9ba:


    "I remembered again how my sister didn't like to be left home alone, how she asked me to come home faster."


translate english test_run_ac759af7:


    "What kind of brother am I?!"


translate english test_run_362a4dd3:


    "Running in the forest that I used to scare my sister with."


translate english test_run_0704c86d:


