translate english bunny2_semen_lose_0028055c:


    "I breathed in loudly. Stood up, massaging my temples."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_a9c205b2:


    "Semyon made a mocking face, as if asking me wordlessly: \"And what are you going to do about it?\""


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_1a62d659:


    "I looked at his red fists that seemed so big to me at the moment and realized: if I said even a single word, I'd get hit."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_1e7cdd6a:


    "And he'll keep on hitting me until I cry, or maybe even that won't stop him."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_1b956393:


    "And nobody was going to help me."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_269d65e1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/45 Prostite.ogg"
