translate english bunny2_semen_lose_7a066277:


    "My muscles became wooden, and I felt him wiping his hand on my back."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_7d770b9b:


    "I continued walking, listening to demeaning smirks from all the sides."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_17b0099e:


    "It was even worse than I expected."


translate english bunny2_semen_lose_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_29c76304:


    "\"Oh, I'm so sorry!\", Semyon would say while shoving me off the staircase, in a way that could break my neck."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_83101fdf:


    "Or, \"Oops, didn't mean that!\", after spilling kompot on me in the cafeteria."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_0667240b:


    "And this kept happening every day."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_0fded371:


    "I couldn't relax for a moment because of this string of \"coincidences\"."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_500e4043:


    "And to my horror, I realized that it was only going to get worse and I couldn't do anything about it."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_09a79826:


    "I always walked looking down at school, and counted down minutes until the classes ended."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_7bde5fba:


    "Only in rare moments when I caught Polina's look on me, I choked from embarrassment and was ready to fight, but as if to mock me, nothing happened."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_cbc69f4e:


    "And then my rage subsided and everything returned to normal."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_b48f5c14:


    "I always went home alone."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_6751716f:


    "First I slipped through the village, then over the bridge across the river, and then, finally, through the forest."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_9c6039c9:


    "The road slithered between the trees for around ten minutes."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_4d6491a9:


    "There were no passersby, only cars slowly crawled past me, as if afraid to sink in snow."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_d8ac9f82:


    "I tried walking as fast as possible, because branches, white from the snow, and black trunks created an illusion of someone wandering the forest."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_8dc1f235:


    "Somebody tall, sneaky, who can turn into a tree or a snow pile, and then, when nobody is looking at them, continue their journey along the road."


translate english bunny2_solo_win_1170abd4:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/28 Nu z.ogg"
    Sem "Yo, Antoshka!"


translate english bunny2_solo_win_ca0c41f9:


    "My heart nearly stopped."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_21b0e312:


    "Snow danced in the air outside the window, following the rhythm of the music that was flowing from around the corner."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_861172c3:


    "I jumped off the windowsill and started walking along the hallway, curiosity eating away at me."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_f469782c:


    "The half an hour I'd spent here waiting crawled at snail's pace. I wanted to see Polina again."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_aa5e3fa8:


    "The music became louder, it streamed out of the half-open door at the far end of the corridor."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_afa0999b:


    "My music taste was limited to {u}Letov{/u}, Shevchuk, \"The Timeless Classics\", and pop songs I saw on TV."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_199138f4:


    "Along with music videos that would sometimes be put on tapes as teasers before a movie."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_d7d25630:


    "But this violin melody captivated me."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_407fd83d:


    "It felt like a master woodcutter working with delicate wood, a fragile crystal toy, a gust of warm wind."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_7ccbf4f3:


    "I pressed my cheek against the doorway."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_a391a4db:


    "Polina was hiding from me in the far end of the classroom, but a shadow that fell on the wall definitely belonged to a girl with a violin."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_e72f64d5:


    "The movements of her bow were so graceful that I felt like I was getting carried away on the waves of music."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_e096a362:


    "My heart broke the barrier of my ribcage and started hopping around."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_18f7da2d:


