    "Polina adjusted her hair, slightly embarrassed."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_6a5d9878:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/71 Spasibo.ogg"
    Pol "Thanks."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_1743558b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/100 I chto ze.ogg"
    Ant "And is that the end of the rhyme?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_3e582960:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/100.2 Prines im zayac.ogg"
    Ant "Did the bunny prepare those meals?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_33201ef5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/72 Podi.ogg"
    Pol "Who knows..."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_6fcc145e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/73 Sprosit.ogg"
    Pol "Nobody will be able to tell you now, it's really old."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_7ef468ea:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/74 Drevnaya.ogg"
    Pol "I'd even say ancient."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_1ad1e32f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/75 S nei.ogg"
    Pol "There's a legend related to it, though."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_d24de7bb:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/76 Esli tebe.ogg"
    Pol "Want me to tell you?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_b09da256:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/101. Konechno.ogg"
    Ant "Of course!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_e9c5f047:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/77 Tut v taige.ogg"
    Pol "All sorts of tribes had lived in the taiga back in the day."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_2b3bcd10:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/78 Dedushka.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa told me they had this... insti... initi... well, some sort of rite when a boy was ready to become a man."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_bc574a05:


    "I listened closely."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_6ea92e78:


    "I mean, I was also really close to that age myself."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_72d2b4ae:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/79 Young.ogg"
    Pol "They would lead him into the woods where he needed to spend three days hunting."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_c64aa4c8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/80 Po legende.ogg"
    Pol "There's a legend about a young man who went into the taiga and never returned."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_ebd6108f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/81 A vernulsya.ogg"
    Pol "And then suddenly came back when they already stopped looking for him."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_a94839e0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/82 Nagryanul.ogg"
    Pol "He was covered in scratches, dirty, cold."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_0578c1d2:


    "I imagined sleeping among the pines and bear lairs."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_649def4b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/83 Rodnie.ogg"
    Pol "His family rushed to help him, but he just fell unconscious."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_da7b7430:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/84 Priveli.ogg"
    Pol "They brought a shaman..."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_2809a062:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/85 Tot.ogg"
    Pol "He looked at the young man and his face became grim."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_e7a0c25b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/86 Skazal.ogg"
    Pol "He told them that he was in bad shape."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_662ad837:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/87 Du utra.ogg"
    Pol "The young man convulsed until the morning, repeating that rhyme over and over."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_e74151b3:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/88 Snova.ogg"
    Pol "Over and over."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_75d6d7e1:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/89 Raz dva.ogg"
    Pol "One, two, time to play with you... As if Taiga itself was whispering it to him."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_cf7d25eb:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/90 A k rassvetu.ogg"
    Pol "And when the sun came out, he died."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_3e211b2a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/91 Tolko.ogg"
    Pol "But the shaman said that he was already dead when he returned, he came out of the woods as a living corpse and whispered that rhyme with his dead lips."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_8f0584ec:


    "I froze in fear."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_3c7cc4f4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/102. Eto tochno.ogg"
    Ant "Are you sure it's not some horror movie?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_0406b10b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/92 Folklor.ogg"
    Pol "Folklore can be way scarier than movies, believe me!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_5116e95f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/93 Dedushka.ogg"
    Pol "Grandpa said that this tribe just uprooted in a hurry and left to the south."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_93fca796:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/103 Oni bili.ogg"
    Ant "They must've been brave."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_6b5cae73:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/103.2 Esli.ogg"
    Ant "If they lived here."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_c67f94c6:


    "Polina kicked one of the snow piles with her small boot."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_fa1e2d96:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/94 Smelimi.ogg"
    Pol "Brave, but stupid."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_0cba432b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/94 Neuzeli.ogg"
    Pol "Did they need a corpse to appear from the forest for them to understand?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_8e752f57:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/104. Doshlo chto.ogg"
    Ant "Understand what?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_c0e3d2b0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/95 Chto nuzno.ogg"
    Pol "That they needed to get out of here."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_f79b69cc:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/95 Est.ogg"
    Pol "There's the big world."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_2bbf462d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/95 A est.ogg"
    Pol "And then there's our village."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_0075ad78:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/96 Mir.ogg"
    Pol "The world..."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_e9828f00:


    "She spread her arms wide."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_a22b188d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/97 Poselok.ogg"
    Pol "The village."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_cdb1400b:


    "She showed a distance that was almost invisible with her two fingers."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_d1caa6f9:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Ya chasto.ogg"
    Pol "I often imagine big cities."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_7745e9a5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Mogu.ogg"
    Pol "I can look at the globe for hours."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_c4b72a08:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Ili zurn.ogg"
    Pol "Or at 'Around the World' magazines from the library."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_4bb0a9ad:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Kakie ze tam.ogg"
    Pol "They have such pretty names! Just listen."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_007cf489:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Reik.ogg"
    Pol "Reykjavik."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_08b872d0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Telaviv.ogg"
    Pol "Tel-Aviv."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_b89dae69:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/98 Eto ze.ogg"
    Pol "Music to my ears!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_831552b6:


    "She started circling, her eyes shut dreamingly."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_ed2e8060:


    "The forest towered before us, touching the low clouds."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_d89d53d7:


    "The road fell into the semi-dark between the trees."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_46b6a3fd:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/99 Ya bi mogla.ogg"
    Pol "I could've conquered the stage!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_5ce593a5:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/99 Vistupat.ogg"
    Pol "Performing in front of thousands...!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_1b519abc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/105. A ya scene.ogg"
    Ant "And I have stage fright."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_fd8d1e50:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 Tak ti.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, you'll get famous another way! By drawing!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_ddcc66e2:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 U nas.ogg"
    Pol "We both have a future, but what about, say, Semyon?"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_4a7ee2da:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 Nu stanet on.ogg"
    Pol "He may just get fatter..."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_1f98c953:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/100 Nu.ogg"
    Pol "And..."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_c96b95f1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/106. Cakes.ogg"
    Ant "He'll be selling pirozhki!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_6226c69c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/101 Aga.ogg"
    Pol "Yeah, made from dogs."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_3b065988:


    "We burst out laughing, exorcising worry from our minds with lighthearted fun."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_b704b50a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/102 Esli emu.ogg"
    Pol "If somebody will even trust him with selling them!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_f986c69c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/108 Naverno.ogg"
    Ant "Oh, you're right!"


translate english bunny2_polina_win_075db58b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/108.2 On ih.ogg"
    Ant "He can probably eat a whole lot of them in one go."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_2d370775:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/103 Ya tak i.ogg"
    Pol "Like I thought, the forest is less scarier when you're not alone."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_09f1b085:


    "I looked around."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_38ef6527:


    "The snow was sparkling, reflecting the last rays of the setting sun."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_9cea0f6c:


    "My pulse fastened from the thought that we were alone."


translate english bunny2_polina_win_0dba9375:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/109. Da ti.ogg"
    Ant "Yes, you were right."


translate english polwit_c12677a7:


    "Suddenly, I heard nearby bushes rustle, spilling snow in the ravine"


translate english polwit_9dc407dc:


    "A giant man walked from them, fastening a zipper on his pants."


translate english polwit_5d30dd15:


    "I recognized him. He was in the school yard this morning."


translate english polwit_e4e72947:


    "He gave us an indifferent look and just walked away."


translate english polwit_1348e99f:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/104 Nu i tip.ogg"
    Pol "What a shady guy!"


translate english polwit_1b8c24ef:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/104 Horosho.ogg"
    Pol "It's so good that you're here with me, Anton."


translate english polwit_546e2c2b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/105 Kto znaet.ogg"
    Pol "Who knows what this thug would've done if you weren't by my side..."


translate english polwit_370fc6b9:


    "She gave me a look full of admiration."


translate english polwit_9d539f1d:


    "And when the big man had almost disappeared behind the trees, she stuck out her tongue at him and laughed."


translate english polwit_857f9658:


    "Such a little rascal."


translate english polwit_48ec9118:


    "Polina rushed through the firebreak."


translate english polwit_88bdfafe:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/106 Ne ots.ogg"
    Pol "Don't fall behind!"


translate english polwit_195486cb:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/110. Nikogda.ogg"
    Ant "I never fall behind."


translate english polwit_b476cf02:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/107 Ti znaesh.ogg"
    Pol "You know, the way you speak..."


translate english polwit_e3c41d84:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/107 Kak pers.ogg"
    Pol "Just like a hero from adventure books."


translate english polwit_62713ced:


    "Was she complimenting or mocking me?"


translate english polwit_b579a1e5:


    "I didn't want to look for the hidden meaning. Not when we're on such a wonderful walk."


translate english polwit_b0ca7352:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/111. Nu da.ogg"
    Ant "I mean, I like books."


translate english polwit_1e0710e9:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/108 Ogo.ogg"
    Pol "Oh, a well read man?"


translate english polwit_fbe9ea69:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/108 Zvuchit.ogg"
    Pol "Intriguing!"


translate english polwit_67ce7162:


    "A man? Really?"


translate english polwit_a9f258ec:


    "I got embarrassed and my cheeks turned beet-red, but I still thanked fate for being able to wander around the forest with Polina like this."


translate english polwit_b255c159:


    "The girl suddenly stopped and stared into the darkening thicket without making a sound."


translate english polwit_5d342243:


    "As if waiting for something."


translate english polwit_475af4b4:


    "I felt uneasy, all of a sudden. "


translate english polwit_168dc53b:


    "And then she asked me in a cold voice:"


translate english polwit_dc126a8c:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/Te bul.ogg"
    Pol "Have you been there?"


translate english polwit_e10e0e6d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/112. Gde v.ogg"
    Ant "Where? Deep in the woods?"


translate english polwit_5e99b1b6:


    "Polina burst out laughing again, shattering my anxious thoughts."


translate english polwit_dafb3d59:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/110 Da net.ogg"
    Pol "No, silly!"


translate english polwit_6af67c51:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/110 V bolshom.ogg"
    Pol "In the big world!"


translate english polwit_55241f66:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/110 V gorodah.ogg"
    Pol "In cities with musical names."


translate english polwit_c261144f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/113 A razve.ogg"
    Ant "Does Moscow sound musical to you?"


translate english polwit_84a26135:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/113.2 Bolshe pohoze.ogg"
    Ant "To me it sounds like the croaking of a frog."


translate english polwit_58d8b660:


    "Polina froze and looked at me in disbelief."


translate english polwit_f8819d31:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/111 Ti bil.ogg"
    Pol "You've been..."


translate english polwit_73fd5d2b:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/111 V moskve.ogg"
    Pol "...to Moscow?"


translate english polwit_d0e6050b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/114 Nu da.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah."


translate english polwit_738751ab:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/114 V detstve.ogg"
    Ant "When I was little."


translate english polwit_5b1f2df7:


    "Polina's eyes started sparkling."


translate english polwit_bbac3451:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/112 I kakaya.ogg"
    Pol "What's it like?"


translate english polwit_6073fe82:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/115 Nu krasivaya.ogg"
    Ant "Well... it's beautiful."


translate english polwit_0ec7af38:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/115.2 Shumnaya.ogg"
    Ant "Noisy."


translate english polwit_7e936c00:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/115.3 Neonovaya.ogg"
    Ant "Neon lights everywhere."


translate english polwit_3e0de948:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/113 Neon.ogg"
    Pol "Neon lights..."


translate english polwit_92c139c9:


    "It felt like she was savoring those words."


translate english polwit_e737f6c7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/114 A na krasn.ogg"
    Pol "Have you been to the Red Square?"


translate english polwit_61652f84:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/116.1Konechno.ogg"
    Ant "Of course."


translate english polwit_a5ae539a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/116.2Onatakaya.ogg"
    Ant "It's so... bumpy."


translate english polwit_b95b07f8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/117 I v TSUMe.ogg"
    Ant "I've been to {u}TsUM{/u} and {u}VDNKh{/u} too."


translate english polwit_c05b63cc:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/117.2 Mne bolshe vsego.ogg"
    Ant "I loved the metro the most."


translate english polwit_222f5d05:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/117.3 Tam tak.ogg"
    Ant "It smelled like..."


translate english polwit_4c23a3ee:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/115 Kak.ogg"
    Pol "Like what?"


translate english polwit_ba53a904:


    "She ran up to me, grabbed me by the sleeve, and stared in my eyes with clear interest."


translate english polwit_cf42bc1b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/118. Ne mogu opisat.ogg"
    Ant "I can't describe it."


translate english polwit_0b5fc37e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/116 A naris.ogg"
    Pol "And can you draw it?"


translate english polwit_89a40157:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/119. Chto zapah.ogg"
    Ant "What? A smell?"


translate english polwit_6ec79742:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/117 Velikie.ogg"
    Pol "Great musicians can play smells."


translate english polwit_c7d68fe0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/120. Ne mozet bit.ogg"
    Ant "You're lying!"


translate english polwit_93ea3734:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/118 Ya dam tebe.ogg"
    Pol "I'll give you the cassettes later."


translate english polwit_5c57a48c:


    "She started twirling in the falling snow again."


translate english polwit_901e57b7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 ya obyaz.ogg"
    Pol "I'll definitely go to Moscow."


translate english polwit_43fcacb7:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 A glavnoe.ogg"
    Pol "But first–to Vienna."


translate english polwit_0068501e:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 Vena.ogg"
    Pol "It's my dream."


translate english polwit_18689434:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 eto ze.ogg"
    Pol "The capital of music!"


translate english polwit_8686b5f8:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 mozart.ogg"
    Pol "Mozart, Beethoven, Strauss!"


translate english polwit_10a448c4:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 fil.ogg"
    Pol "Philharmonic orchestra!"


translate english polwit_45620cbe:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 gos.ogg"
    Pol "National Opera!"


translate english polwit_23be8083:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/119 ya budu.ogg"
    Pol "I'll be performing and you drawing!"


translate english polwit_b5b0994e:


    "Her enthusiasm spread to me."


translate english polwit_8739e7ef:


    "I wanted to do something, right this moment!"


translate english polwit_115de91d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/120 A ti kuda.ogg"
    Pol "And where do you want to go?"


translate english polwit_60d84e0f:


    "I sighed and confessed."


translate english polwit_f725c3bd:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/121.2Vdisney.ogg"
    Ant "To Disneyland."


translate english polwit_dcc0d083:


    "I remembered the “Finest Hour” show again."


translate english polwit_88f252b4:


    "Olya preferred “Call of the Jungle”, but I always spent my Mondays in front of the TV."


translate english polwit_8c9461b3:


    "Colorful tables with numbers on signs, and a charming Mr. Suponev at the wheel."


translate english polwit_52281a2a:


    "And the prizes!"


translate english polwit_8b14e1f2:


    "Chocolate eggs, video equipment... and the most exciting one—a trip to Disneyland for the winner."


translate english polwit_31b79b0f:


    "My parents promised to take me there, to the land of the mouse, and I believed them at first, well, maybe they also believed it back then."


translate english polwit_81ef2d3c:


    "Now they just reply with silence every time I ask about it, and it saddens me to no end."


translate english polwit_6ee57dc7:


    "I have just three words on my mind in those moments:"


translate english polwit_8c45de4d:


    "But! You! Promised!"


translate english polwit_77866be3:


    "Polina had seemingly read my mind."


translate english polwit_f2136c99:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/121 Dobr.ogg"
    Pol "Getting there is easier than we think."


translate english polwit_3c105d21:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/121 Kazd lepit.ogg"
    Pol "Everybody has the power to mold their fate."


translate english polwit_ea43b118:


    "She picked up two handfuls of snow."


translate english polwit_f64fb93a:


    "And then, as if she forgot about everything, showed me a sly smile."


translate english polwit_b1f85583:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/122 A davai.ogg"
    Pol "Want to make a snowman?"


translate english polwit_e775cd50:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/122. Davai.ogg"
    Ant "Sure!"


translate english polwit_70497e60:


    "When I get back home, I'll make a snowman for Olya too, she'll be so happy!"


translate english polwit_d095638e:


    "But for now..."


translate english polwit_75be5b2b:


    "We were almost done with the first ball, rolling it shoulder to shoulder."


translate english polwit_5279da36:


    "Polina was laughing."


translate english polwit_035edfcf:


    "Locks of her hair fell on her lively face."


translate english polwit_80ae2bbe:


    "She was so cute when she blew them away."


translate english polwit_a584779f:


    voice "voice/anton/2day/123. Perviy gotov.ogg"




translate english polwit_fbaad398:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Ha-ha.ogg"
    Pol "Hahaha!"


translate english polwit_0784aa2d:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Chego u tebya.ogg"
    Pol "Why is your ball so small, Anton?"


translate english polwit_bd6479e0:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Maksimum.ogg"
    Pol "It'll only work as a head."


translate english polwit_b48b1597:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Bolshe.ogg"
    Pol "Make it bigger!"


translate english polwit_2e212c7a:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/123 Ne lenis.ogg"
    Pol "Don't be lazy!"


translate english polwit_5b3d982b:


    "I couldn't remember the last time I had so much fun."


translate english polwit_31fee177:


    "Polina swept her now crimson lips."


translate english polwit_cbc67648:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/124 Ti mechtal.ogg"
    Pol "Did you ever wish to go to another planet?"


translate english polwit_05d20f7b:


    "Something flashed in her eyes when she said that... I couldn't really put my finger on what it was."


translate english polwit_87db763e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/124. I daze v.ogg"
    Ant "To another universe, even."


translate english polwit_75c73913:


    "Polina sighed in what felt like relief."


translate english polwit_cbc6bc24:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/125 Togda.ogg"
    Pol "Then you should understand me."


translate english polwit_b3548851:


    "Our palms glided across the ball of snow, straightening up any bumps it had."


translate english polwit_b2be2a2f:


    "An almost ideal white ball rose up in the middle of the clearing."


translate english polwit_012895b9:


    "Then another one popped up."


translate english polwit_07d826e5:


    "We lifted it up from two sides and placed on the one that served as a foundation."


translate english polwit_3f34225e:


    "Finally, Polina helped the third ball to get on top of the other two."


translate english polwit_eb1e6099:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/126 Stavit golovu.ogg"
    Pol "Getting the head to the right place is what I do best!"


