    voice "voice/romka/2day/71 Nu.ogg"
    Rom "Hoo boy..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_73d4aaf6:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/72 Toha t.ogg"
    Rom "Can you see without your glasses, Toha?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e6318dd8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/175. N-nemnogo.ogg"
    Ant "A little bit..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ff3bb608:


    "A hand, holding a red rectangle, protruded from the mist. Romka was offering me a cigarette."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_4773ec90:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/73 Ugosczais.ogg"
    Rom "My treat."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_684b07a8:


    "I squinted, trying to make out the brand, even though I didn't know anything about cigarettes."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_61289f35:


    "I haven't tried smoking yet, and I didn't really want to start."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e4f4e73d:


    "I wonder if they'll keep hanging out with me if I won't adopt all of their habits?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ec7a548d:


    "After a moment of hesitation, I shook my head."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_5813b4ca:



    voice "voice/byasha/47 Sportsmen.ogg"
    Bya "Into sports, huh? Ha!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_adad4902:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/74 A ty v.ogg"
    Rom "Are you blind or something?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_7de72263:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/75 Ne vide.ogg"
    Rom "Did you see how he thrashed Semyon?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_72251663:



    voice "voice/byasha/49 Da bazaru.ogg"
    Bya "Real deal. Mortal fuckin' Kombat."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_4bde5afb:



    voice "voice/byasha/50 Toha u nas.ogg"
    Bya "Toha here is Rocky Balboa."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_094d3213:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/76 Togda u.ogg"
    Rom "More like Ivan Drago."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e3baa7c7:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/77 Kurim o.ogg"
    Rom "We'll split this one, gimme a light."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1e9a093d:


    "Romka pulled out a cigarette with his lips and Byahsa scrambled to find a lighter inside his pockets."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_3c013e90:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/78 Toha cz.ogg"
    Rom "So, Toha, back to what I was saying..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_9051cd9d:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/79 Ne derzh.ogg"
    Rom "Don't be mad, bro."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_3c77012c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/80 My tebja.ogg"
    Rom "We were just testing you. I mean, your glasses and this mask..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b6998c5f:


    "Byasha lit a giant “Tbilisi” and Romka smacked his lips, taking a long puff of his cigarette."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_966537bc:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/81 Menja k.ogg"
    Rom "I'm Romka, by the way."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c2e7284d:


    "He squeezed my hand so hard that my fingers hurt."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_29c4b1cf:


    "His palms, full of dry, torn blisters implied that he wasn't wearing a tracksuit for nothing."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_899f6c73:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/83 Eto vot.ogg"
    Rom "And this is Byahsa."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c1f18472:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/84 Ty ne o.ogg"
    Rom "Don't worry. We'll have a talk with Porky."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1dd6d534:


    "He let out a cloud of smoke in my face, which instantly made me cough."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_cef43606:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/177. Aga.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_097617f1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/178. Poidu poka.ogg"
    Ant "I'll go gather my stuff, it's getting dark."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e4a45acc:


    "I bowed to pick up my now-empty backpack and look for its contents, hoping that my new buddies will disappear when I turn around."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f5fcdb80:


    "But they just stood there, passing a cigarette back-and-forth."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bd53cfdc:


    "Two small silhouettes with a small light wandering between them, with the pine trunks as the backdrop."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bf28edab:


    "They were waiting for me to finish picking up my textbooks while whispering something to each other."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b6b061c6:


    "Romka was the one talking most of the time, though; Byasha was just constantly sniffing with his running nose and mumbling in agreement."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_0556e651:


    "At that moment, I saw that old, battered bunny mask from papier-mâché among the snow-covered notebooks."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f64b1a50:


    "Its empty eye sockets could be filled with anything, with any eyes, but this mask..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_41569510:


    "...looked like it only wanted mine."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a8213903:


    "Where did it come from and why was it in my backpack?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_3198c0bc:


    "I picked it up with utmost care, as if it could bite off my finger at any moment."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_2ed24492:


    "It was just a carnival mask with a frozen spit on the inside."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_cc06ee58:


    "Still, something felt wrong about it. Something was writhing inside it, underneath the layers of old newspapers..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_5eb4cad8:


    "I could hear a thousand of tiny bodies rustle in the trembling fur."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a498dfdd:


    "Something was trying to chew its way out..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e4de1e7d:


    "MAGGOTS!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c7c98b72:


    Rom "You ready, Toha?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_fe0caa39:


    "Romka's voice pulled me out of my nightmarish delusion and I threw the mask away in horror, somewhere I won't be able to see it anymore."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bf3a9288:


    "My innards were twisted from disgust, but I stood up, trying not to show it."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_d1cc3366:


    "Whether those maggots were real or just one of my delusions, I didn't care."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_316549bd:


    "All of this was too much for a single day."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_58668889:


    "I wanted to get home as soon as possible."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_23706aa1:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/179. Ladno pacani.ogg"
    Ant "R-right, guys, I need to go..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b1a1f097:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/179. Do svidania.ogg"
    Ant "See ya."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_98f6883b:


    "I held out my hand toward the two silhouettes to say goodbye."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_71349d61:


    "A couple of dark, thin lines trembled in front of me."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_91e7911f:


    "They stood without moving, as if studying me."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_008ed2d1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/91 S kedra.ogg"
    Rom "Hey, decided to buddy up with a cedar?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b210712d:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/92 My zdes.ogg"
    Rom "We're over here."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ec84b7fb:


    "I realized that Romka's voice was coming from behind and turned around, embarrassed."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_61db9672:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/93 Derevja.ogg"
    Rom "Trees make for shit buddies."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_42ab2d94:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/94 Ty ne s.ogg"
    Rom "Relax, we'll escort you home, you're as blind as a newborn kitten."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a2e8ec02:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/95 Tak zde.ogg"
    Rom "Without us you'll end up dead around here."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b712ac22:


    "A cigarette butt hit against a stump with a flurry of sparks and started sizzling in the snow near my feet."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6652a67c:


    "The boys let out a strained laugh and took me by the arms."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c0b726b4:


    "When we were leaving the clearing, I turned around in hopes to see Alisa."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_5f44799f:


    "Or at least some orange dot. What if..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_644c9f5b:


    "But I only saw a rumbling tractor that was creeping out from the corner."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_7b48e87b:


    "A silhouette appeared on the side of the road, out of the fog."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c827a860:


    "We made space to let that person through."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_233df09d:


    "Because of my blurry vision and the twilight semi-dark it felt like it was a ghost floating toward us."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_38b15fc7:


    "When the silhouette got close, I was able to make out the features of an adult man."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_672c12e2:


    "I recognized his dumpy outline. He was smoking near the school in the morning."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_dbce75d4:


    "The man gifted us with a busy stare of his cold eyes and moved forward, disappearing into the darkness."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6af86d3c:



    voice "voice/byasha/62 Net gorba.ogg"
    Bya "What a huge harelip."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b2c94e30:


    "I was afraid that the unknown man will hear this offensive rhyme, but he was already too far away."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_7120b42b:


    "We continued our journey."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f7e38210:


    "We were going alongside a still fire road in silence."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c451acd0:


    "The silence felt oppressing, coupled with my lack of vision, so I spoke."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f5f5e69c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/180. A pochemu tebya Byasha.ogg"
    Ant "Why do they call you Byasha?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_43a68335:


    "The buryat kid just smirked in reply."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6010c708:



    voice "voice/byasha/63 Potomu chto.ogg"
    Bya "Cause I'm a wolf in sheep's clothing, eh."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6be5f1e4:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/96 Breshesh.ogg"
    Rom "Bullshit!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8d033f1a:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/97 Purgu g.ogg"
    Rom "Fucking around is what he does best."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f799a7f3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/98 A zvat.ogg"
    Rom "He's got his nickname because he bleats like a sheep."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_93f7816c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/99  vse po.ogg"
    Rom "It started after he returned alive from the Black Garage."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ae4e5891:


    "Byahsa's face contorted at those words. I could see it even through the veil of blindness."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_69e63210:


    "He swayed."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_9cf7b284:


    "And started mumbling something unintelligible."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a14a1419:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/100 Vidish.ogg"
    Rom "See?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_964d308d:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/101 S nim.ogg"
    Rom "Happens every time someone brings it up."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_07facfd8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/180. Ti seichas o chem.ogg"
    Ant "What are you talking about?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_489212b3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/102 Ty ser.ogg"
    Rom "Did you really not hear that horror story?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_185210ca:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/103 Na czer.ogg"
    Rom "On one pitch black street..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b3225d1c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/104 V czern.ogg"
    Rom "In a pitch black alleyway..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_2869adaf:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/105 Stoit.ogg"
    Rom "There's a pitch black garage."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_cbd773d1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/106 I on z.ogg"
    Rom "It knows everything about you..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_fdd6e51f:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/107 Gde ty.ogg"
    Rom "Where you live. What you like. Who are your friends."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_756281a4:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/108 Navern.ogg"
    Rom "I'm sure you've heard about the missing kids."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c3eefdb2:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/109 Eto tu.ogg"
    Rom "This has been going on for a while here..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_60de5a2a:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/110 Vse me.ogg"
    Rom "The local folk know who's behind all of that."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_545054cb:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/111 Dazhe v.ogg"
    Rom "Even the adults."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_4904bfaa:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/112 Voobscze.ogg"
    Rom "You got lucky, you live right on the edge of the forest..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_2c206a21:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/113 On k t.ogg"
    Rom "This thing won't come there without a good reason."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_7f9e7b83:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/114 Tupo s.ogg"
    Rom "It knows that it'll look too foreign among the trees."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8b79d365:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/115 A u na.ogg"
    Rom "While in our area, this piece of crap can hide anywhere: be it at the end of an alleyway or near your house."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_69041d24:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/116 A escze.ogg"
    Rom "Also..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_14e83af4:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/117 Idesh.ogg"
    Rom "You'll be just going somewhere at night and bam!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b4c366c3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/119 On sto.ogg"
    Rom "You see it in some place that was empty just a while ago."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ad69d281:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/120 Dver.ogg"
    Rom "Its door open, pitch-dark inside..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b8f30a65:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/121 I tut.ogg"
    Rom "And then..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a3239fa3:


    "Byasha pulled his cape over his head and started howling on a high trembling note, trying to silence Romka."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_212a4d2e:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/122 Ladno.ogg"
    Rom "Fine, forget it..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_3f27bb64:


    "I was trying to process Romka's story but I couldn't figure out what to think of it."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8e180c07:


    "During the short time I've been in this snow-laden village I realized one thing: a lot of people here had some sort of experience with something they couldn't explain."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_9245ac65:


    "I looked at Byasha, who was pit-pattering to the side."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6e5c4e92:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/123 Toha.ogg"
    Rom "Tell me, Toha, why the hell did you move here?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_692ceb69:


    "I heaved a deep sigh while looking at my feet."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6bff22dd:


    "Somewhere down below, the tips of my boots scooped up fog."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ed274b63:


    "I spoke words that I recited countless times:"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8371c138:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/182 U otca tut.ogg"
    Ant "Dad has a new job here."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_7250502b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/182.2 I mama v poselke.ogg"
    Ant "And my mom used to live here."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e3e7713d:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/182.3 Davno eshe.ogg"
    Ant "Back in the Soviet days."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_45e818b1:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/124 Zdes.ogg"
    Rom "There's nothing to do here but rot away."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6e2047eb:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/125 Nu ili.ogg"
    Rom "Or, well, like Bysha here, wander around the forest."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8f021e81:


    "Bysha fearfully showed his face from under his hood, like a snail crawling out of its shell, and listened in."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_11501faf:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/126 On u n.ogg"
    Rom "He's a camper, see."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_be1bc299:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/127 Letom.ogg"
    Rom "Spent a whole week in a tent last summer."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_72d4a879:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/128 Zdes.ogg"
    Rom "Here, nearby."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bcef23dc:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/129 Prikin.ogg"
    Rom "Cool shit, right?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_92c13077:


    Rom "..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_01791731:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/130 Hotja o.ogg"
    Rom "I mean, with a crazy old woman like his, I'd also flee to the forest."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bb82fa86:


    "We kept on going, but it felt like it was the forest that was sliding by."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ae9985ad:


    "Pines were the black keys, and the space between them–the white ones."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8a4b5b0a:


    "The thicket was playing its old creaky melody, the melody of roots, bear caves and forgotten Taiga sketes."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_cbac9c4b:


    "Snowflakes flew around, creating a disturbing illusion."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_6f52ec50:


    "That somebody was wandering the forest."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1ff52176:


    "Somebody tall, unnoticeable, ready to camouflage as a tree or a snow pile..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_cfd8f59c:


    "And then, when nobody paid attention anymore, they'd just continue moving along the road."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_06a9c40c:


    "But it was just a trick of the light. There was no one there."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a5353a12:


    "At least I wanted to think that."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_184b781e:


    "Romka suddenly stopped and said." with hpunch


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1c3d60f6:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/131 Slyshte.ogg"
    Rom "Hear that?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_d1a91e5c:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/132 V lesu.ogg"
    Rom "Someone is snooping around the forest..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_25cbe576:


    "The skin under my clothes started itching, my stomach started aching."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_fad29874:


    "We looked the way Romka was pointing."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_06c2021e:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/133 Vysocze.ogg"
    Rom "Really tall, matching our speed..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b1dbda19:


    "There were no tall silhouettes behind the masts of pines."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_14104841:


    "Just shadows, creeping in the semi-dark."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1d523daa:


    "Slow shadows."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b69aff44:


    "Fast shadows."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_25d7293d:


    "Hungry shadows."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_9bfe9d35:


    "The snow that fell silently from the branch, made me shiver and bite into my lip."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f7fa7b28:


    "As if something huge lifted off the tree and flew away."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b84a43be:


    "Maybe even toward us..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_873b97e3:


    "Romka picked up a pinecone from the ground and threw it into the thicket."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_99f231e0:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/135 Ei A.ogg"
    Rom "Hey!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_eac1aec3:


    "His shout ricocheted as if it hit a tightly sprang drum. The echo mocked Romka. Then the silence reigned again."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_072c35c8:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/136 Ktoni.ogg"
    Rom "Did you see that?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a035379b:


    "I shook my head."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_62e6f95b:


    "The only things I could see were the vertical strokes of trees, the darkness, the snow and the hazy silhouettes of my companions."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_db2f5211:


    "I remembered the rough-textured trunks, the spongy lichen and the icy bits on the bottoms of the ravines."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8dd176a9:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/183. Poiemte skoree.ogg"
    Ant "Let's move faster, the sun is setting."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_87005117:


    "I was again grabbed by the elbows and dragged along, toward the forest, toward the pointy spires of branches."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_cb5c6cf8:


    "The sun had finally sunk behind the green peaks."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_73d98c4f:


    "The darkness writhed, spread its shoulders and started spreading like smoke."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_3d62359b:


    "It started snowing. Thick, sticky flakes. White flies, following the scent of dead meat."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_533ab923:


    "My vision had become a small island, awash by dark waters."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b6838310:


    "I was grasped by the same worrying feeling I had in the morning."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c6ba3fb9:


    "I felt that somewhere far away, at the edge of my comprehension, I heard a very calm and silent flute playing."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1d087d00:


    "The sound was fragile, like ice in March, above the dormant waters of a bottomless lake."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f2414aa4:


    "I scraped inside of my ear with my finger to get rid of that auditory hallucination."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_40636bdb:


    "The forest was silent."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ff4b1c55:


    "I imagined a child, walking at night under the watchful eyes of pines."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_f4410d0e:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/184 A vi znali Vovu.ogg"
    Ant "Did you know Vova Matyukhin?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_d5a5576b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/184.2 Malchika.ogg"
    Ant "The boy who went missing recently?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_0f524bc3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/170 A razve mi.ogg"
    Alis "Weren't we looking for him, sweetie?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_44bc6438:


    "I shuddered and stopped, staring at the person who was guiding me."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ab2cea12:


    "At Alisa, in her unchanging fox mask."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c5a620c9:


    "The girl was gently holding my elbow."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_505e3dea:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/185 Chto ti zdes.ogg"
    Ant "What...? Why are you...?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8e6d0bc7:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/185.2 A ved ya tebya.ogg"
    Ant "I lost sight of you!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_a48cf966:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/171 Poteryal.ogg"
    Alis "You did, because you were careless."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_aa8e4c81:


    "I squinted in suspicion."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_eefd0830:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/186. I davno ti.ogg"
    Ant "How long were you following us?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_d43d298f:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/172 Chto znachit.ogg"
    Alis "What do you mean 'how long'? I was always by your side."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_3064b6a3:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/173 Da i za kem.ogg"
    Alis "And who 'us'?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_51b47db5:


    "Stunned, I looked around, but couldn't find Roma or Byasha."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_b6332857:


    "And then I felt her cold finger on my wrist."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_06d34b14:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/175 Poidem ze.ogg"
    Alis "Let's go!"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ec61eda0:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/176 Mi sobiralis.ogg"
    Alis "We were going to look for Vova."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_ae43ff29:


    "Without a chance to catch my breath, she started dragging me along through the forest."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bea472f0:


    "I was enveloped by the smell of tangerines, coffee and fire crackers."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_9f002560:


    "I felt like I was a small kid again, being led into the unknown."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_1cad1652:


    "I saw the dark silhouettes of trees ahead. The bushes-hedgehogs were wary, showing us their spikes."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_d69826cb:


    "Something rectangular appeared in our way like a small box..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_43e61e33:


    "I became petrified."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_0f211cbe:


    "I touched the edge of my eye, pulling back the eyelid, as if I was trying to correct my vision."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_bc576b5b:


    "A garage made of metal rose up right from the windfall."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_952696a2:


    "It was big, no, huge, impossible to move without special equipment."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e8587be8:


    "Its walls were painted black, even blacker than the darkness around us."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e0b2c667:


    "The fox sniffed around and it seemed like her mask twisted in disgust."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_2053d623:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/178 Eto zdes.ogg"
    Alis "This is the place."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_8eac20d9:


    "The worried voice of my companion scared me even more than this horrifying metal box."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_e2412f53:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/187. Zdes.ogg"
    Ant "Here?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_0a8397b2:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/179 Ya slishu.ogg"
    Alis "I can smell him..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_39a5a7de:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/180 Mozet Vova.ogg"
    Alis "Maybe Vova is playing hide-n-seek with us and he decided to hide..."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_7266f5fb:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/181 Vnutri.ogg"
    Alis "...inside?"


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_d0695642:


    "I felt like I saw smoke form tentacles that split off the garage, searching for something in the wilted leaves."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_182847f0:


    "These tentacles slithered along the snowy blanket, getting close to our feet."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_480ca195:


    "And there was a scary screeching sound coming from the other side of the huge black metal gates."


translate english bunny2_skip_mask_c88f0415:


    "Somebody or something definitely waited for us inside."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_950579da:


    "I thought that my nervous movements were similar to that of a marionette, dangling in the hands of a puppeteer."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e7c0e990:


    "I stepped toward the garage, holding my breath..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_b5a3da3d:


    "...and gave the sheet metal door a small knock with my knuckles."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f1dda148:


    "Knock-knock!"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_831ee8f2:


    "And then jumped back."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_64dbadc6:


    "For a moment it seemed like someone growled in pain inside the metal walls."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_6a706cf2:


    "I heard rusty meat hooks jingle on thick metal chains, awakening someone huge, who crawled to open the black gates."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_3e56b6ec:


    "Nothing happened."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_d79a6686:


    "My heart was racing."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f5b87a6f:


    "Still nothing."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_42c1b8f5:


    "Knock-knock."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e14ce0c4:


    "I hesitated to turn my back to the garage so I took a couple of slow steps back, unable to tear my eyes off the stench-oozing crevice, and was about to call Alisa, when...{w=2.5}{nw}"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_9e89f1d7:


    "\"{i}Run!{/i}\" – I heard a weak, scared voice resound in my head."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_bbd21498:


    "Stumbling all over the place, I still rushed into the night that was swarming with shadows."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_11f76479:


    "I ran behind the crooked trunk of a pine, sure that Alisa was by my side."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f4b36938:


    "But after a moment had passed, I realized that the girl was nowhere to be found."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e81c15df:


    "The forest was mumbling its ancient chants."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_06a5aa43:


    "Squeaking, ticking, rustling."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_c6c99ca7:


    "I froze."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_3e5c2a3d:


    "I didn't know how much time had passed before I realized that I was standing in complete darkness, in a circle of trees that were shooting up their trunks high into the sky."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f4abafc0:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/165. Moi ochki (Polina).ogg"
    Ant "“My glasses...”"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_743d3052:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/99 CZto.ogg"
    Sem "What, can't see anything without them, sucker?"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_bc454ad6:


    "He threw up his hand that was holding my glasses toward the sky, so I couldn't get to them."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_111e2c6f:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/166. Otdai seychas.ogg"
    Ant "Give them back! Give it back right..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_97c49d61:


    "I was interrupted by a leaden fist with a sharp signet that hit me in the brow, producing a cracking sound, throwing me to the frozen earth."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f674a3f6:


    "A circle of blurry faces, dying from disgusting laughter was mocking me, making me want to puke."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_f57bf705:


    "And as soon as I was almost able to catch my breath, a blurry figure rushed toward me..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_4613151b:


    "...but instead of a new hit, I was offered an outreached hand."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_687e0004:


    "I immediately grabbed it, hoping it was Polina, but I soon realized how wrong I was, after I felt the sting of dry blisters on the palm."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_53af4e0a:


    "It was Romka. He helped me stand up."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ebdcca3f:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/137 Pravda.ogg"
    Rom "Can't see anything, for real?"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_1a5ef9fe:


    "His voice sounded compassionate, which surprised me."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_b8795d3c:


    "I squinted, trying to find Polina in the fog before my eyes. She was gathering my things and putting them back in my school bag."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ca5c339e:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/138 A slysh.ogg"
    Rom "And what about your hearing?"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_0e71eb80:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/167. A.ogg"
    Ant "Huh?"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_427dbd0a:


    "He leaned in close and asked with a voice that was way less friendly."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_840258df:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/139 Slyshish.ogg"
    Rom "Can you hear me fine, Antoshka?"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_91e569b8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/168. Da.ogg"
    Ant "Yeah..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_abe52c88:


    "I blinked in bewilderment."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_051f43b6:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/140 Nu tak.ogg"
    Rom "Well, then listen closely."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_5a9fe47f:


    "He brushed off my coat."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_454b3747:


    "And then hit me in the jaw with all his might."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_8cab7c2c:


    "My jaw clicked. If my tongue was between my teeth at that moment, I would not only be blind, but I would also talk worse than Byasha."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_1c9a17df:


    "I staggered, the world around me spun like a peg-top again. Romka held me by the elbow, preventing me from falling over."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_c6a466c4:


    voice "voice/Polina/2day/138 Gde-to.ogg"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_8ee978df:



    voice "voice/Polina/2day/139 Anton (gde-to).ogg"
    Pol "Anton!"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_27a40414:


    "Byasha locked her in his arms, preventing her from running to my side."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_3d07a8c3:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/142 Eto te.ogg"
    Rom "Consider this a warning."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_cfa452ad:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/143 Escze ra.ogg"
    Rom "If I ever see you anywhere near Polina, even a meter close, I won't let it slide."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_86ff8c63:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/144 Ty pon.ogg"
    Rom "Got it?"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_2056bb64:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/170. D-da.ogg"
    Ant "Y-yeah..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_b00d226a:


    voice "voice/romka/2day/145 CZisto.ogg"
    Rom "And this is to make it stick."




translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ad51b1a0:


    "His fist landed on my temple."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_ce6a2458:


    "The world turned upside down."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_7c9f0285:


    "It felt like I was falling into the sky the color of decaying meat."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_dd0e1f8e:


    "I grabbed the roots to stop myself from tumbling more."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_907d4984:


    "My consciousness was drifting on top of the abyss, gliding to its depths like a deflated balloon."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_a79a0681:


    "I tried to get up."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_df1125e6:


    "A blurry silhouette that probably belonged to Polina was fighting back, but two others held her by the hands and dragged her away."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_d12dae17:



    voice "voice/byasha/Mi domoi.ogg"
    Bya "We'll take ya home, don't be scared, eh."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_7b91bab2:



    voice "voice/semen/2day/100 Mal.ogg"
    Sem "Yeah, who knows what kind of psychos roam this forest."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_1de1a736:



    voice "voice/romka/2day/146 A Tosha.ogg"
    Rom "And Tosha here should rest for a bit..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_aa4f5c26:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/171. Polina (Tosha).ogg"
    Ant "Polina!"


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_eb22fe14:


    "Romka's boot met with my face."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_e6f47010:


    "My hand got twisted, the back of my head hit the ice. My eyes obediently rolled over."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_21b04505:


    "The darkness jumped out, took a stance..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_fa3cbbdf:


    "Just to devour me."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english bunny2_fox_garage_dev_a1266d00:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/142. Semen.ogg"
    Ant "Ugh... Cough..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9bf61907:


    "I turned around, dug my nose into the bed sheets. Forced my eyes open with great difficulty."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_aebc9ab4:


    "Paintings on the walls. Books. A pile of comic magazines."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5c8173b8:


    "I felt up my chin, afraid that it will respond with sharp pain."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_281a6b55:


    "My fingers slid across my face to my temples. No bumps, no pain."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_11b18b13:


    "I sat up, blinking in surprise. Fixed my glasses."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e9b0b5c2:


    "Studied my hands. Clean, without any mud under the nails."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2f658558:


    "My school bag was reclined against the table. I heard bits and pieces of a conversation through the door."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1fc526ce:


    "I was at home, in my bedroom."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e28c8691:


    "Did I get here myself? And what about the glasses? Did Semyon return them? Polina, maybe? Or an unknown friend?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_df8657a1:


    "I decided to leave that question for later and looked out the window. The forest had many secrets and it wasn't in any hurry to reveal them to me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6567e101:


    "The clock on a night stand showed 10 a.m."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_03fb36a0:


    "The sun was already above the field, but it didn't bring any warmth."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c2dd439e:


    "The thicket moaned from its cracking bones."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_37640ae5:


    "I went out into the hallway, and the conversation became clearer. Laughter... I haven't heard mom laugh in so long."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8272c84d:


    "In a silent house, among the sneaking shadows."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c10a4a34:


    "Such an ordinary, but dear laughter."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1bf9b043:


    "I sneaked through the ladder to the lower floor, as if afraid to spoil that moment."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3f29a478:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/13 A ya emu.ogg"
    Pap "And then I ask him: 'Do you have any comics? I want to buy some for my bunny.'"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fd0a8c08:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/13 A on vash.ogg"
    Pap "And he goes: 'Your rabbit reads comics?'"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2d79b9bc:


    "Mom burst out laughing. Olya followed suit."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_167996b2:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/14 Nu da govoru.ogg"
    Pap "'Well yeah!', I tell him, 'My bunny is well trained!'"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c865214e:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/108 Bozhe ty.ogg"
    Mam "Gosh, you're the best!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1cdfe4d4:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/15A ti somnevalas.ogg"
    Pap "Did you doubt me?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e6e64303:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/109 Ni na.ogg"
    Mam "Not even for a second!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a9c44229:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/48 Zenih.ogg"
    Oly "Mom and dad sitting in the tree!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6378598d:


    "When I entered the kitchen, mom was kissing dad on the forehead and he was gently stroking her shoulder."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d7545b4c:


    "Olya sat between our parents, armed with a fork."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fcef2c19:


    "A polka-dotted cooking pot emanated a pleasant aroma even with the lid on."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2fd6d415:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/16_a_vot.ogg"
    Pap "Here he is!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a883f4b4:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/111 Privet.ogg"
    Mam "Hey there, sleepyhead! Took after your father in that."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bc44d30b:


    "The white canvas of a frosted window behind mom's back made it look like she was on someone's painting."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_185c48aa:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/17_sadis.ogg"
    Pap "Come on, sit down, take a load off your feet!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e3c65cc6:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/18_zavtrak.ogg"
    Pap "Breakfast is the most important thing for any healthy person!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b37715f9:


    "I sat down, a charming smile on my lips."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e9cd923c:


    "Olya winked at me and the lamp on the table flickered in unison with her."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_63ec4378:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/112 Zaspanny.ogg"
    Mam "You look so sleepy!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_053efa6b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/19_kakoy_yest.ogg"
    Pap "Well, what can you do, he's our child! It's already too late to hand him over to an orphanage!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_01865e0a:


    "Dad let out a dry laugh to show he was joking. Mom slapped him on the shoulder."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_336fbb8f:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/49 Oi ya.ogg"
    Oly "I'm so hungry!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d4eefa7d:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/113 A my.ogg"
    Mam "Do you think you're the only person who's dripping saliva over here?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3ec6fe67:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/50 Bratik.ogg"
    Oly "Big bro, will you eat like this?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d9edb2e7:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/204. Kak.ogg"
    Ant "How?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3e456c16:


    "I caught the sparkling gazes of my parents on myself."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1c24d550:


    "If I had a camera at that moment, I would've taken a snap so I could always look at those smiles on a photograph."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e7109bf0:


    "I wanted this beautiful moment to last forever."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4e8d6ebe:


    "The lightbulb went out and then came back. The window glass shuddered slightly."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3c114aa4:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/114 Snimy.ogg"
    Mam "Take the mask off, son. It'll get in the way of eating."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ad28b04a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/205. Kakyu masku.ogg"
    Ant "What mask?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_35b06650:


    "A silly smile got stuck on my face."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_cd1547c2:


    "Dad showed me his sturdy white teeth that looked like piano keys."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d6179239:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/20_snimay.ogg"
    Pap "Come on, take it off, bunny."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_7f0fec2a:


    "I slid my hand across my cheek. Let out a laugh."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5d91b50b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/207. Vi o chem.ogg"
    Ant "What do you mean?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_48f24f39:


    "The whole family was laughing now, pointing their fingers at me and slapping their knees and the tablecloth."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b420b78a:


    "Dad wiped his wet eyes with his knuckles."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_acd4624b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/21_nasmeshil.ogg"
    Pap "Well, good job making us laugh, son."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5e1cc284:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/22_a_teper_masky.ogg"
    Pap "Now take off your mask, please."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3a997966:


    "I touched my face again. My skin went numb."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_78a8d323:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/208. No na mne.ogg"
    Ant "But I'm not wearing a mask..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0bd63a9d:


    "Mom fidgeted on her chair. She tilted her head and squinted."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0046a5c7:


    "The canvas behind her back turned gray and kept getting darker with every passing moment."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_27792774:


    voice "voice/karina/2day/117 Poka ne.ogg"
    Mam "We can't start until you take it off."




translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_7777a3bc:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/52 No ya.ogg"
    Oly "I can't wait anymore!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fc418571:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/23_snimi_masky.ogg"
    Pap "Take off the mask. Stop fooling around."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_98ffe476:


    "His voice was kind, but firm."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b7e98c19:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/53 Mam.ogg"
    Oly "Mooom... Tosha is scaring me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_010930dd:


    "Chair legs scraped against the floorboards. Olya moved away from me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ced9ab11:


    "She wasn't smiling anymore. Actually, there wasn't a single smile left in the room, if you don't count the cracks in the walls."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b94b359e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/25_chto_nadelal.ogg"
    Pap "What have you done? You made your sister cry!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5c673ff6:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/209. No.ogg"
    Ant "But..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f1803adc:


    "Olya sobbed, her eyes downcast, sneaking fearful glances at me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c1b3c838:


    "Mom slammed her fist on the table and I almost fell to the floor along with the chair."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e1629be7:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/118 Syn.ogg"
    Mam "What disgrace of a son! We were all having fun and then you came around and ruined everything!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_12dde6af:


    "Splashes of saliva flew at me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9c37f22b:


    "I turned to dad, begging him to explain what was going on."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_33b3f3ca:


    "Sticky syrup trickled down dad's beard, falling on his shirt. His eyes were looking in different directions."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c6381d2c:


    "There was a loud sound in the attic. Water pipes grumbled."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fe895238:


    "The house was alive."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_53ee7734:


    "Every room had someone rustling, moving around, breathing in it."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4944ba59:


    "The lightbulb started flickering like a stroboscope."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d108f975:


    "The faces of my parents disappeared into the darkness only to appear again moments later."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e0ff1448:


    "Outside, a tall shadow walked past the window."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f30b3310:


    "I was about to jump up and run away but my body wasn't listening to my commands, my hands just obediently stayed on the table."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_65406e71:


    "I was just an onlooker."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_185be18a:


    "The lights went out. I spent three heartbeats in complete darkness."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4d9fc5b6:


    "Then the bulb flashed with blinding light."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a39e0de4:


    "Three masks were looking at me with their gaping eyes."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_650ee620:


    "A fox woman, where my mom was just a moment ago."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f6b3f8ef:


    "A wolf man at the head of the table."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bb732d6d:


    "And a bunny girl. My Olya."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c1e89823:


    "I couldn't even ask why they wore these strange, scary animal faces."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9e9759d6:


    "And why the fur on them was moving, as if there's something writhing inside the masks, making the papier-mâché bulge."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_59d4bce0:


    "My tongue didn't listen to the commands my brain sent to it."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bc84e118:


    "I could only shift my gaze between the masks. Watching the long, twisted shadows behind the backs of my family."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bd23655b:


    voice "voice/karina/2day/119 Kyashat.ogg"
    Mam "Bon appetit!"




translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c9af7ee6:


    "She tore off the lid from the pot."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_17132c22:


    "A cut-off head was lying in the bloody gravy."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6f6160a9:


    "A pair of glazed eyes was drilling me from inside the pot. Its mouth was open in a silent scream."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_eca6f86e:


    "The head at the bottom of the pot... belonged to me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_123b9a61:


    "Blood ran down the agonized face of the cut off head."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_95a1a9d5:


    "At the same time, something hot started streaming from my nostrils, scarlet drops falling on the tablecloth."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c89f7b23:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/120 Esh.ogg"
    Mam "Eat up!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_438cd1fe:


    "I screamed."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a20cefa7:


    "..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8f536ff1:


    "I jumped up. My jaw was burning. As were my temples."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e6468b0d:


    "The kitchen, the beasts in animal masks, and the dead head — everything had disappeared."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9979576f:


    "Everything but the goddamn mask that was haunting me. One of the delinquents put it on me for the laughs."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d1366b9a:


    "I tore off the bunny face that had already stuck to my face, threw it into the darkness and realized that I woke up near the crumbled snowman, in the forest."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a4cfd7af:


    "Covered in snow and coniferous needles. Without my glasses and with a smashed face."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_35839a79:


    "So I blacked out... horrible..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_867f0938:


    "Pulsating pain seemed like a gift compared to the horrors I just witnessed."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_50055e48:


    "I stood up, spitting out blood."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2fa60dd0:


    "The forest seemed like a prison that was keeping me in with its wooden bars. I didn't know how long I was out."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9aa91c15:


    "My limbs were numb from the cold. My pants were soaking wet."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1a9f70b2:


    "I stood alone in a ring of towering trunks, not being able to see anything."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_cad5a8d7:


    "Everything around me moved, trembled. My ears went numb from all the rustling."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a6534b63:


    "The treetops melted into the darkness of the cosmos."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2d8c53bd:


    "The bushes became empty cells, whose occupants were suddenly set free."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0a5b2458:


    "It felt like a clawed fang could fly out of that darkness into my stunned face at any moment."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_23dfdb57:


    "I heard a scream somewhere far away."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d9f19e0a:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Antooon.ogg"
    Noname "Anton!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dc852f1f:


    "Someone was looking for me. Just like..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a53e46a6:


    "...that boy who went missing."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_804140e0:


    "Tears stung my eyes. A big drop fell from my lashes."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_eb122af1:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Antooon2.ogg"
    Noname "Anton!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1212bdb7:


    "The scream was closer now, and for a moment I even believed that I was about to be saved."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_44afc908:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/188. Ya zes.ogg"
    Ant "I'm here...!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8c56523c:


    "The light hit my face. I covered it with my hand."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d6e9aeae:


    "One of the trees moved."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a3673dca:


    "It wasn't Romka. Nor was it Byasha."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d89c075a:


    "An adult. Tall, with long arms."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_25e9f2ca:


    "Many shadows that looked like dogs, snuck around behind his back, but those beasts were much larger than Zhulka."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b7e3b8bc:


    "The forest was dormant no longer, no longer it hid its face behind the fake masks."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5a9f3690:


    "I stood still, like a deer pierced by the lights of an incoming truck, and the beasts all stared at me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4bd938b8:


    "In this semi-dark, without my glasses, I could see very little, but it was still more than enough for me to freeze in terror."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_441734fc:


    "A foul smell of animal piss and wet fur enveloped the clearing, when the creepy procession with the giant at its head moved toward me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_69e0d830:


    "My legs gave way because of fear and I fell to my knees, into the snow. It looked like I was praying to that figure, to the trees, to the darkness."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_270e9931:


    "I didn't dare lift my eyes, so when he got close, showering me with his stench, for a moment I thought that his legs were covered in gray fur."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_17871447:


    "I shut my eyes so tight that red circles started dancing on the inside of my eyelids."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_cd9ca1c4:


    "I don't want to look!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f9a600e7:


    "But I could still hear everything."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ef3a7497:


    "His breath was akin to sandpaper that was scratching at my ears."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6700d43b:


    "His voice was deep, hoarse. No, it wasn't a voice. A roar."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_40253270:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/02 Hrr A.ogg"
    Noname "Raaawr..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_424bb012:


    "I fished my grandma's chant out of the pool of my memory:"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d0763be8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/190. Mertvoe.ogg"
    Ant "Ashes to ashes! Dust to dust! Ashes..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2973654a:


    "I got his stench and roaring in reply."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_82a514d4:


    "Words could never protect against claws and fangs. I was helpless."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_01ca1ed4:


    "And then I've heard a familiar sweet voice nearby."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_29b0ff20:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/183 Nu ze.ogg"
    Alis "Come on, do it! Get a taste of him."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e24ff65a:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/191. Ne nado.ogg"
    Ant "No!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c61e0486:


    "Something hot slid across my throat, like a meaty, sticky rope."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a15f81c7:


    "Someone's tongue."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f2d879ab:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/184 Ya ze.ogg"
    Alis "I told you, Master!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9dc121d6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/185 Eto nash.ogg"
    Alis "He's our bunny."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_562c3fea:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/186 O nem.ogg"
    Alis "Please, take good care of him."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a91a85bb:


    "From the narrow embrasures of barely lifted eyelids, covered by my trembling fingers, I watched a horrifying silhouette tower over me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d4b09ed5:


    "I was taking in the smell of kennels, compost pits and moss."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2872a818:


    "In front of me stood a scary horned beast with the presence of a monarch."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_44e59605:


    "His posture told me of his electrifying nobleness."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_25d949c0:


    "His horns supported the clouds and his popped-out leuсomas pierced my ready to pop eyes with a thorny stare."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_f9ecaada:


    "His hands were full of gifts."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_69597d23:


    "Candy fell to the snow, sparkling with its fancy wrappers. Silvery packs of chocolate bars, and a Chupa-Chups sticking out from a snow pile with its plastic stick."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2988afe5:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/03 Tebe.ogg"
    Master "F-for you-u-u!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_0261f0ed:


    "Candy rained at my feet."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_817abbb0:


    voice "voice/anton/2day/fear8.ogg"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_bd6ed0a9:


    "A doll fell nearby. And then is started raining toys: a spinning top, a teddy bear with a torn-up nose, redheaded Karlsson without a propeller, a tin toy soldier with a flag, a firefighter truck and a crop-duster plane..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e5afa70d:


    "The toys weren't covered in blood, but my imagination was painting them with red spots and crimson leaks all on its own."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_918fce23:


    "The horned shadow of the beast moved over the treasures that once belonged to unknown kids."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4f3c7ebe:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/04 Beri.ogg"
    Master "T-t-ta-a-ke."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_df9f5b41:


    "Hairy hands reached into surrounding darkness, took out a mangy bunny mask that was haunting me..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dfb0b180:


    "And forcefully pulled it over my face."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a8a784eb:



    voice "voice/kozel/2day/05 Zaichick.ogg"
    Master "Bunny."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_25a20648:


    "The shadows of beasts around us slowly and graciously stood up on their rare legs."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6b256c37:


    "And then light hit my face, shattering the monster's figure in two."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9353c0c1:


    "I put up my hand to protect myself."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8ed2a454:


    "Flashlight's ray slid down."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4cd4446e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/32_anton_vot_ty_gde.ogg"
    Pap "Anton! There you are!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a563d76a:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/33_sovsem_sdyrel.ogg"
    Pap "Are you out of your mind?!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3c98f818:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/32_Anton_Z.ogg"
    Pap "Anton!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3bf86ee1:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/32_vot_ty_gde.ogg"
    Pap "There you are!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_279897b7:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/33_sovsem_sdyrel.ogg"
    Pap "Are you out of your mind?!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4b28ec0e:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/34_eto_voobshe_kak_ponimat.ogg"
    Pap "What's this all about?!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c6bf311d:


    "My dad walked out from the shadows."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5bf3b80e:


    "I went toward him, hoping that he won't melt, that he's not another trick that my insane mind played on me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6c59c72a:


    "He turned out to be real, warm and alive."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_fdc4907a:


    "I was staring at my dad, completely stunned. Into the space where the monster was just a moment ago."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d8a72140:


    "The clearing was enveloped in darkness again, but I could still barely make out the outlines of toys and candy in the snow."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_38a0495d:


    "And I'm sure if I was brave enough to get close to the bushes, I'd find animal prints there."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_60dc64e9:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/39_yazik_proglotil.ogg"
    Pap "Cat got your tongue?!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c016f605:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/39_ya_vstretil_odnoklassnicy.ogg"
    Pap "I've met a girl from your class on the road. She said..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e76111d5:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/36_ondoklassniki_tvoi.ogg"
    Pap "Your classmates came to us!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ee41755c:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/36_skazali_chto_sbezhal.ogg"
    Pap "They said that you ran away from them, deep into the forest and..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8ff67639:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/36_chto_za_dryan_napyalil.ogg"
    Pap "What the hell are you wearing...?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_81a4bbfa:


    "I pulled the mask down from my sweaty face and threw it into the heap of toys."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_6118b9bb:


    "Branches cracked in the distance."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_8a477d1d:


    "I pressed myself into my father's chest, engulfed by fear. And he started looking around, alerted."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_db161afe:


    "And spoke in a tone of voice that was much more nervous."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_024b51ad:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/41_poydem_otsyda.ogg"
    Pap "Okay, let's get out of here."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_c1607f5b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/41_mat_yznaet_kakoy.ogg"
    Pap "If your mother learns of this, she'll be so mad at us that we'll never forget this day!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_eaae37d3:


    "I reached out for my father, still feeling the chilling embrace of fear."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9b5b2bbe:


    "I grabbed his firm hand, felt his quick pulse with my fingertips."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_383e5940:


    "Then stood up and wobbled along behind my father, following his barely discernible footprints."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ea959f1e:


    "Back to civilization, back to light, back to the road where my dad parked his car."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dcf43bfb:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/43_doma_ni_slova.ogg"
    Pap "And not a word about this at home, got it?!"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9a65af9c:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/43_ni_edinogo_nameka.ogg"
    Pap "Don't even hint at where I found you."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d30d8dd4:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/194. Da pap.ogg"
    Ant "Alright, dad."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_36991087:


    "He was holding my hand as if it was the most precious thing in the world and kept telling me how afraid he is to lose me or Olya."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_15ef5576:


    "I nodded and moved my legs."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a20cefa7_1:


    "..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4c7d9bde:


    "Only when we got to the car, dad noticed my scratches."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_55475c3c:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/45_tebya_bili.ogg"
    Pap "Somebody hurt you?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b594bcb1:


    "I felt up my cheek."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_70e75287:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/195. Podralsya.ogg"
    Ant "I got into a fight..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a78db4eb:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/48_iz_za_chego.ogg"
    Pap "Over what?"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_b1ef0239:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/196. Iz-za devushki.ogg"
    Ant "A girl."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_db92180f:


    "Dad replied with a thoughtful nod."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_16ca79b7:


    "I heard the low hum of the engine."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3f49dcb5:


    "My dad wore a fearful expression. It wasn't that sticky fear that paralyzed me in the nightmare, though."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4f52993c:


    "His fear was noble, like crystal clear diamond."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_be29bd6c:


    "He opened the glovebox and got some napkins out of there."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9e3cecc9:


    voice "voice/father/day_2/49_mama_by_seychas.ogg"




translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_da62b406:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/49_dratsya_za_devushky.ogg"
    Pap "Fighting for the girl you like is right."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_9306c95f:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/51_nyzno_reshat.ogg"
    Pap "Yes, normally you'd try to resolve things with words. It's just... sometimes words don't work."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_7a1efd37:


    "Dad flashed an encouraging smile at me."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2236e6a7:


    "Right as he was about to close the glovebox, I noticed a handle peeking from under of a rug."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_71bf25b7:


    "He was carrying a gun around. My dad, a true intellectual, had a pistol with him. Like an action movie hero."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_2e6d3f91:


    "{i}\"Or like an ordinary thug\"{/i}, some voice whispered to me. "


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_47cba6b3:


    "Pines were flying by in the window. The car's light were struggling against the darkness."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_4f2e56c5:


    "The car carried me back home. Dad was cautiously studying me in the back mirror."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5d1dee6b:


    "I was thinking about the gun, about my dreams, about people in animal masks that pretended to be my parents."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_3b09f86b:


    "But it wasn't that sticky like an animal tongue fear."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_e8eb508b:


    "His fear was a noble, crystal clear diamond. And I just nodded in reply and kept moving my feet."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_24b5ef79:


    "And then I heard a familiar voice, coming from behind me:"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a0be3d3d:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/187 Pomni.ogg"
    Alis "Remember..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_d9b462c6:



    voice "voice/Alisa/Alisa2day/188 Poka.ogg"
    Alis "As long as you're with me, nobody will lay a finger on you here."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_a20cefa7_2:


    "..."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5a296b85:


    "The car sped toward our house."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_5872c97d:


    "I pressed my cheek against the window and saw a short building among the trees, a shack darker than night."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_70f5c86d:


    "The garage that was hidden inside the thicket. A crypt made of metal."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_1661c63c:


    "It almost felt like it was following us."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_ffef0761:


    "A moment passed and the building disappeared around the corner"


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_dd1cc902:


    "I gulped down my dolor."


translate english bunny2_happy_family_nightmare_657be259:


    "And the white snowflakes just kept dancing in the starry sky."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_baeffe94:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/05 Tak ya ne.ogg"
    Mam "Hey, what's this... Where are your glasses, Anton? Did you lose them?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_abd546a8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Danumam.ogg"
    Ant "See, I..."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_fb26fa52:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/06 I kak.ogg"
    Mam "How can you be so careless? Do you think I own a money printing press?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_7c826de7:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/06 Кakze.ogg"
    Mam "Yeah, right! You'll be wearing your old glasses until next year."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_128338d7:


    "Olya rushed to me."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_e4e3ea29:


    voice "voice/father/day_2/53_a_vot_i_my.ogg"




translate english bunny2_home_evening_06eeb0a9:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/Yavilis nezapililis.ogg"
    Mam "Look what the cat dragged in!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_5d268b67:


    "Mom was going down the stairs, piercing dad with her trademark glare."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_86e99377:


    "Her face showed something between wrath and condescension."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_d8eaedce:


    "Suddenly, her gaze shifted to me and stayed for a dangerously long time."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_baeffe94_1:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/05 Tak ya ne.ogg"
    Mam "Hey, what's this... Where are your glasses, Anton? Did you lose them?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_e6bc098b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Da v shkole.ogg"
    Pap "This dummy probably just forgot them at school."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_92ed087e:


    "A venomous pause followed."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_0dfe5346:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/04 Ves.ogg"
    Mam "He's your son, alright."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_cc623b33:


    "Dad glared at mom and then mischievously winked at me, reminding me of our deal. "


translate english bunny2_home_evening_c3f18f57:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/Nu nichego.ogg"
    Pap "Well, we have spare glasses so we'll manage somehow."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_92dac484:


    "My parents stood in silence a bit longer and them both of them went to mind their own business."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_c9668956:


    "Olya threw herself into my arms before I could even take off my coat."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_1357ba80:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/04 A ya.ogg"
    Oly "I saw a fox!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_449d9e9e:


    "Surprise akin to a shotgun blast."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_7f73c68f:


    "I could only flap my lips in reply."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_b16cd6e7:


    "A cup shattered into many little pieces with a loud thang."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_74bc3627:


    "My mom let if fall from her hands."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_6a526f4a:


    "Her face was pale and her eyes were glued to the ground."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_ea1564a6:


    "This pause, just a split second, felt like an eternity."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_c50f66cf:


    "Then my mom spoke with disappointment:"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_777bddaa:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/88 To sova to lisa.ogg"
    Mam "First it was an owl, now it's a fox!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_e0dfd3dd:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/89 Kogda zh.ogg"
    Mam "Will you ever get tired of this?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_a40999a9:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/05 Pravda-pravda.ogg"
    Oly "But it's true!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_fe3a47fa:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/06 Takaya.ogg"
    Oly "She was so fluffy!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_d38a15de:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/07 Ona u zabora.ogg"
    Oly "She stood on her back legs, near the hedge, just like a person."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_c17db89b:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/08 Ona menya.ogg"
    Oly "The fox called my name, but then mom came and she fled."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_8f99ea53:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/90 Ne bilo tam.ogg"
    Mam "There was no fox."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_3f650de5:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/91 Ne vid.ogg"
    Mam "Stop making things up!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_d0642c18:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/212. Ne podhodi k nei.ogg"
    Ant "Don't go near her!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_f2f3942b:


    "If it was necessary, I was ready to shake my sister as if she was a doll made of cloth."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_9ffaaf27:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/09 Ti chego.ogg"
    Oly "What's wrong, Tosha?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_6f6e2ff8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/213. Ne podhodi slish.ogg"
    Ant "Don't go, you hear me?!"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_6763db01:


    "Mom entered the hallway and gave me a surprised look."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_b0277fbe:


    "I hesitated."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_3035267b:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/214. Nu lisa ved.ogg"
    Ant "Well, a fox will bite you."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_ce4108af:


    "I remembered fairy tales where foxes used to kidnap children."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_ca61f047:


    "I imagined my Alisa, liberated, carnivorous, running through the night forest with a dangling sack in her hands."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_23f1bd90:


    "I imagined Alisa, liberated, carnivorous, running through the night forest with a dangling sack in her hands."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_4c12205d:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/92 Eto ze.ogg"
    Mam "It wasn't a real fox. "


translate english bunny2_home_evening_fb8c9c17:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/93 Rasskazi.ogg"
    Mam "Tell him, Olya."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_953c4e04:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/10 Ona na.ogg"
    Oly "She stood on two legs and she wore a dress."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_332b747a:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/11 Tolko ona.ogg"
    Oly "And she was real."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_4eb5229d:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/94 Vidish.ogg"
    Mam "See?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_bde3724c:


    "Mom showed us a tired smile, as if it was the only explanation needed."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_1bdfe85d:


    "I also forced myself to smile."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_029da0b1:


    "My smile was like a thin piece of soap, right before it dissolves completely on your palm."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_17dc1c73:


    "But when I was left alone with my sister, I whispered:"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_51d2c40c:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/215. Eshe raz.ogg"
    Ant "If you see her again, run."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_e296527c:


    "Memories about my family in disgusting masks attacked, bombarded me like the underhanded blows of my classmates."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_5388e389:


    "The furry faces of my family stood before my eyes, their toothy mouths, full of thick saliva."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_19d193f4:


    "What's happening to me?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_6e7e4bc3:


    "What kind of tricks is my mind playing on me?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_47c357bf:


    "This bunny mask was real. It just appeared in my school bag out of nowhere, as if I never threw it away in the forest."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_6aab693b:


    "Thoughts of the forest beast bombarded me like a rain of candy and toys."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_dfd32328:


    "There was a hairy silhouette standing in front of me, towering over the treetops."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_77813321:


    "Who was he? What happened in the forest?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_19d193f4_1:


    "What's happening to me?"


translate english bunny2_home_evening_7ae65de0:


    "I shut my eyes and threw the vitamins in my mouth. Washed them down with water."


translate english bunny2_home_evening_0e705f7b:


    "Please, stop driving me mad. Please."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_d5dbc47c:


    "I barely managed to force myself to do homework, but those math problems just refused to be solved."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_dc7bfe1f:


    "Numbers in my notebook tumbled around and mixed in a whirling dance, sometimes running over the lines."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c1a431a4:


    "My head became heavy from that pandemonium and I almost dropped it into that chain of numbers."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a6208c31:


    "My eyelids felt like there were tiny weights tied to them, the type used in grocery stores."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_9417e8b6:


    "And right at the moment I surrendered and closed my notebook, the memories of my day started flashing before my eyes."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_801ca47a:


    "I was doing my homework on a Friday evening, like usual."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2b4f1e9e:


    "I had already finished the hard part."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_151d538e:


    "There was only my art homework left. My favorite subject."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_d5f7abe8:


    "I needed to draw some sort of magic beast."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_461bdffe:


    "I wanted to draw a dino at first, but my brush reached toward the orange paint all by itself."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_322861da:


    "One stroke after another, the picture of a fox started slowly forming on a piece of paper."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f7447bc7:


    "She was almost popping out of the snow white sheet."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_0a68415d:


    "She stood on her back legs and wore a sly smile."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e83675a3:


    "My brush moved again, drawing a fluffy tail. A moment later, it dropped out of my weak hand."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_205d4b06:


    "After I finished my drawing, I spent a while studying it in surprise, as if I couldn't understand where this red beast came from."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_5671e505:


    "The longer I looked, the scarier her smile felt."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ec62154c:


    "Carnivorous, fake, like the smiles of women form adult magazines that were sold in press kiosks back in the city."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ef18976e:


    "An alluring smile that masked deep seated malice."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f81f1ad6:


    "And the fox's eyes turned out red, as if bloodshot."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a07d007e:


    "They looked more like bullet holes you see in action movies."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e6e92568:


    "I don't remember drawing them this way."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_7e83ba8d:


    "I moved away from the table and the lamp's light reflected from the wet paint."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_7524ce4e:


    "The drawing was glossy. It felt like the fox was watching me."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f4ccc382:


    "Waiting..."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_650c389e:


    voice "voice/father/day_2/55_anton.ogg"
    Pap "Anton!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_663ca060:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/56_ty_ogloh_B.ogg"
    Pap "Are you deaf?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c2761792:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/217. Ya zadumals.ogg"
    Ant "I... I was just thinking..."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_68143d59:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/57_tebya_sprashivau.ogg"
    Pap "I'll ask you again, have you seen your sister?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_72f1e974:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/58_opyat_ona_gdeto.ogg"
    Pap "She's hiding somewhere again."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_49a8276e:


    "Something moved under my bed and I froze."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c4c13261:


    "Olya's dirty face peeked out with a finger pressed to her lips."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_762236ce:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/13 Tss.ogg"
    Oly "Shhh."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_7c145aff:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/59_olya_ya_vizhu.ogg"
    Pap "Olya! I can see you."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_9c2e8d4b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/59_vylezhai.ogg"
    Pap "Get out of there. You're covered in dust!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_6013a7a6:


    "Olya crawled from under the bed and started dusting off her stockings, looking down."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_64d160b7:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/60_poydem_ol.ogg"
    Pap "Let's go."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2b271ae5:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/60_ya_tebe_skazky_pochitau.ogg"
    Pap "I'll read you a fairy tale."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_5068a23b:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/60_posizhu_s_toboy_poka.ogg"
    Pap "Keep you company until you fall asleep."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f4cd89d6:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/14 Ya s vami.ogg"
    Oly "I want to sleep with you. Not in that room."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_963d0354:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/15 Tam.ogg"
    Oly "It's..."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2870c108:


    "Mom entered the room."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_3547b730:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/102 Chto opyat.ogg"
    Mam "What, the owl again?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_c7fb241f:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/61_a_kto_eshe.ogg"
    Pap "And what do you think?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_42f12ce4:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/61_ol_ona_ne_pridet.ogg"
    Pap "Olya, it won't come anymore."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_1cd31267:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/61_ya_ee_prognal.ogg"
    Pap "I chased it away."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_4ee58437:


    "Olya shook her head in defiance."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_148c1168:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Neprognal.1.ogg"
    Oly "You didn't."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e80c5929:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Onapridet.2.ogg"
    Oly "And it will come."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ba9aa114:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Ona skazala.3.ogg"
    Oly "It said that it'll come every night."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_375607ad:



    voice "voice/father/day_2/62_o_tak_ona.ogg"
    Pap "Oh, it talks now?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_d7c86999:


    "Olya ignored the question and then asked with newfound determination:"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_208cbe1f:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Moznoyasva.1.ogg"
    Oly "Can I sleep with you?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_41665d8d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Mozno.2.ogg"
    Oly "Please?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_bff4ad70:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Vsamiposledni.3.ogg"
    Oly "This will be the last time."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_47bf8998:


    voice "voice/father/day_2/64_kryahtit.ogg"
    voice "voice/karina/2day/103 Ty ze govorila.ogg"
    Mam "Didn't you say yesterday was the last time?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_43ff6005:


    voice "voice/father/day_2/63_olga_ty_yzhe_bolshaya.ogg"
    Pap "Olga, you're a big girl now..."




translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2b273d34:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/Apust.ogg"
    Ant "Why don't let her sleep in my room?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_b144830c:


    "I thought it was a great idea. But Olya shook her head again."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_81b612f7:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/18 Net u tebya.ogg"
    Oly "No. I don't want your room. It watches you too."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_21bc3017:


    "I felt goosebumps all over my body."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_8cf1b1fc:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/104 Hvatit.ogg"
    Mam "Enough!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_cf86e983:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/105 Net nikakoy.ogg"
    Mam "There's no owl!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_1ae542ba:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/105 Ty segodnya.ogg"
    Mam "You're sleeping in your own room tonight, got it?"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_63e28d8d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nupozaluistamam.ogg"
    Oly "Mom, please!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_621ce3f2:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Pozaluista.ogg"
    Oly "Please!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_db6656c0:


    "Mom took Olya's hand and tried to lead her out of my room."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_ef053e5f:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/106 Poydem milaya.ogg"
    Mam "Let's go, sweetie, don't bother your brother."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_4aa30553:


    "Olya clutched the bed's head with her free hand."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_889077a3:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/PozaluistaPozaluista.ogg"
    Oly "Please! Please! Please!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_9ef7873d:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nehochyknei.ogg"
    Oly "I don't want to go to it!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_44a0d149:


    "Mom was tugging Olya toward herself, but she didn't budge, only the bed's head squeaked in agony."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_304a07c4:


    "Dad intervened by picking Olya up and carrying her out of the room, despite her desperate protests and pleas."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_57328fbe:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nenado.ogg"
    Oly "No!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_1a61fb1c:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Nenadoknei.ogg"
    Oly "Don't take me to it!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_88f9939e:



    voice "voice/olya/2day/Onaopyatsmotret.ogg"
    Oly "It's going to watch me again!"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_2899033f:


    "I've listened to them struggling to make my little sister go to bed for a while."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a6df4a01:


    "In the end, my parents gave up and let Olya sleep with them."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_cd232cb9:


    "But it was surely the last time. Ever."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_f30a2b77:


    "When everybody settled down, I was lying in my room, thinking about Olya's words:"


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_a038bb74:


    "It's watching you too."



translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_0acea364:


    "I felt uncomfortable."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_e208a4ad:


    "I barely managed to calm down only after closing the curtains in my room shut."


translate english bunny2_night_room_anton_table_55e88530:


    "But as soon as I closed my eyes, memories of my day started jumping around in front of me."


translate english day2_nightmare_c986b703:


    "I was in the middle of the stuffy school corridor."


translate english day2_nightmare_f0227932:


    "I could see the literature classroom from here: the faces of dead classical writers on their portraits, the prim and regal pose of our homeroom teacher, Lilia Pavlovna."


translate english day2_nightmare_a6fe7ba9:


    "And around that corner was her daughter Katya, a snitch and a gossip, eagerly waiting for me."


translate english day2_nightmare_7b25238d:



    voice "voice/kate/15 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Hey, transfer student! Transfer student!"


translate english day2_nightmare_e01fce44:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/219. Chego tebe.ogg"
    Ant "What do you want, Katya?"


translate english day2_nightmare_7a580114:


    "She got on her tip-toes and started swaying, while hiding her hands behind her back, and then asked me with a fake smile on her face:"


translate english day2_nightmare_c9a2d820:



    voice "voice/kate/16 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Can I ask you something? Why did you get transferred here?"


translate english day2_nightmare_ea980f9d:


    "I might have told the truth about this to Polina."


translate english day2_nightmare_15182214:


    "But Katya will sell it on the market for three kopeikas. It would be the same as printing all my thoughts and hanging them near Vova's picture, for everyone to see."


translate english day2_nightmare_232b9f9c:


    "So I reverted to an answer I knew by heart."


translate english day2_nightmare_6ea49044:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/220 Eto vse.ogg"
    Ant "It's all because of my parents..."


translate english day2_nightmare_faa9b193:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/220.2 U papi.ogg"
    Ant "Dad has a new job here, and my mom... my mom..."


translate english day2_nightmare_66b3616b:


    "But Katya didn't even listen to me, just rushed toward the perked-up ears of her friends, whispered something while stealing glances at me and giggling."


translate english day2_nightmare_f139ff72:



    voice "voice/kate/17 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Yeah right!"


translate english day2_nightmare_f0855326:



    voice "voice/kate/18 KA.ogg"
    Kate "He takes us all for fools."


translate english day2_nightmare_a57da774:



    voice "voice/kate/19 KA.ogg"
    Kate "I've heard it's all because of his father."


translate english day2_nightmare_55750c13:



    voice "voice/kate/20 KA.ogg"
    Kate "He crossed the road of some big shot and now their family is hiding in our remote little village."


translate english day2_nightmare_391ded90:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/221. Nepravda.ogg"
    Ant "That's not true! You're lying!"


translate english day2_nightmare_95e3f6b0:



    voice "voice/kate/21 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Oh, and did you hear how he hit Baburin out of the blue?!"


translate english day2_nightmare_ecc158fb:



    voice "voice/kate/22 KA.ogg"
    Kate "What kind of freak must you be to start bullying your classmates from day one?!"


translate english day2_nightmare_056a4040:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/222. Prekrati on perviy.ogg"
    Ant "Stop! You know he started it!"


translate english day2_nightmare_95c2baf1:



    voice "voice/kate/23 KA.ogg"
    Kate "And did you hear, did you hear how Baburin beat him up?!"


translate english day2_nightmare_73e4b8a7:



    voice "voice/kate/24 KA.ogg"
    Kate "And all he could do was look all pathetic and take it."


translate english day2_nightmare_319b2ee8:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/223. Prekrati ne odin.ogg"
    Ant "Stop it! You know he wasn't alone!"


translate english day2_nightmare_f1976bd2:



    voice "voice/kate/25 KA.ogg"
    Kate "And if that wasn't enough..."


translate english day2_nightmare_23c74b4e:



    voice "voice/kate/32 KA.ogg"
    Kate "There are rumors that this weirdo carries a bunny mask with him wherever he goes."


translate english day2_nightmare_0ec83e58:



    voice "voice/kate/33 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Who in their right mind would do something like that, huh, girls?!"


translate english day2_nightmare_a256839c:



    voice "voice/kate/34 KA.ogg"
    Kate "I see, I see, our Antoshka must be truly special."


translate english day2_nightmare_bbf15fa8:



    voice "voice/kate/35 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Maybe he's an autist, but what if..."


translate english day2_nightmare_56ee0596:



    voice "voice/kate/36 KA.ogg"
    Kate "...he's a serial killer?"


translate english day2_nightmare_52f64465:



    voice "voice/kate/38 KA.ogg"
    Kate "I'm sure you'll be able to find an axe in his backpack if you look hard enough, or something even worse!"


translate english day2_nightmare_ada749bb:



    voice "voice/kate/26 KA.ogg"
    Kate "There are rumors that he's hanging out with delinquents from Romka Pyatifan's gang."


translate english day2_nightmare_0dfa5d19:



    voice "voice/kate/27 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Be careful with your bags, girls!"


translate english day2_nightmare_54aa5bf9:



    voice "voice/kate/28 KA.ogg"
    Kate "I wouldn't be surprised if things start disappearing from our wardrobe."


translate english day2_nightmare_ba6bc255:



    voice "voice/kate/29 KA.ogg"
    Kate "And we'll know who to blame — Petrov and his friends."


translate english day2_nightmare_23c74b4e_1:



    voice "voice/kate/32 KA.ogg"
    Kate "There are rumors that this weirdo carries a bunny mask with him wherever he goes."


translate english day2_nightmare_0ec83e58_1:



    voice "voice/kate/33 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Who in their right mind would do something like that, huh, girls?!"


translate english day2_nightmare_a256839c_1:



    voice "voice/kate/34 KA.ogg"
    Kate "I see, I see, our Antoshka must be truly special."


translate english day2_nightmare_bbf15fa8_1:



    voice "voice/kate/35 KA.ogg"
    Kate "Maybe he's an autist, but what if..."


