translate english day2_nightmare_06472478:


    "I got up."


translate english day2_nightmare_6892d788:


    "My vision fooled me, moving the window closer only to push it farther the next moment."


translate english day2_nightmare_57c49de7:


    "My sister was just a blurry spot."


translate english day2_nightmare_5aff6b47:


    "I took a hesitant step forward."


translate english day2_nightmare_115408df:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/231 Ol.ogg"
