translate english day2_nightmare_0b86b563:


    "She stared at me with eyes that were red from crying, with her hands wrapped around her shoulders. Her voice was nervous, as if she was afraid to hear my answer."


translate english day2_nightmare_9d586105:



    voice "voice/anton/2day/234. Ya razgovarival.ogg"
