translate english day2_nightmare_8e216edd:


    "The ledge outside my windows creaked ominously, as if something huge was sitting on top of it."


translate english day2_nightmare_f3c33d99:


    "And the thing that pretended to be Olya started spreading, changing shape, grow to scary heights under the light of a carnivorous moon."


