translate english day2_nightmare_a5d0dc7d:


    "The voice didn't belong to my sister anymore."


translate english day2_nightmare_39efd88e:


    "The thing that was hiding behind my curtains got tired of pretending. Making me look like a fool."


translate english day2_nightmare_ee9f6adf:


    "I pinched myself as hard as I could, hoping that the silhouette near the window was just a continuation of my nightmare, a hallucination, brought upon by the cursed house. And those don't bite, do they?"


translate english day2_nightmare_49682bca:


    "The silhouette was towering before me under the veil of mist..."


translate english day2_nightmare_5e2f87a7:


    "I heard Olya's shrill scream when someone had knocked on the window."


translate english day2_nightmare_f1dda148:


