translate english day2_nightmare_1eea48aa:


    "Another knock. I stepped back into the middle of the room."


translate english day2_nightmare_8fe042f2:


    "As if there existed nooks where I could hide from this horror."


translate english day2_nightmare_f1dda148_1:


    "Knock-knock!"


translate english day2_nightmare_91f7405b:


    "The sound was sharp, metallic."


translate english day2_nightmare_011f06f5:


    "The lamp started shimmering, then it suddenly lighted the whole room and went out, like a candle in the strong wind. The filament inside it snapped with a ringing sound."


translate english day2_nightmare_789457a9:


    "The darkness that was waiting for that exact moment, poured from all the angles and enveloped me."


translate english day2_nightmare_49fb88b6:


    "There was only this window left in the whole universe: moonlight poured through it, painting everything the color of bones that were exhumed from a crypt."


translate english day2_nightmare_d31e658e:


    "Olya started squealing and pressed herself into my back, seeking protection."


translate english day2_nightmare_c7782c1d:


    "And then an eye, burning with a carnivorous fire, stared at us from the window."


translate english day2_nightmare_92efc428:


    "Knock-knock! Knock! Knock-knock!"


translate english day2_nightmare_582b2930:


    "No, it wasn't trying to break the window. It was toying with us."


translate english day2_nightmare_80d20f58:


    "It just kept on knocking, driving us mad."


translate english day2_nightmare_92efc428_1:


    "Knock-knock! Knock! Knock-knock!"


translate english day2_nightmare_054ee0ba:


    "As if a giant clock was measuring the time left for us, its pendulum swinging above the abyss."


translate english day2_nightmare_8ea650a5:


    voice "voice/olya/2day/39 Uhodi.ogg"
    Oly "Go away! Get out! Shoo!"




translate english day2_nightmare_880dc0ef:


    "She was screaming in desperation, her hands clutching my arm like a pair of pincers."


