translate english day2_nightmare_b543b91f:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/100 A s toboi.ogg"
    Mam "And you..."


translate english day2_nightmare_54554eb0:



    voice "voice/karina/2day/101 Mama vyderzhala.ogg"
    "Mom paused, directing her seething eyes at me. She was thinking of a punishment equivalent to my crime."


translate english day2_nightmare_0bc7fa49:


