translate english day2_nightmare_9611f448:


    "I managed to get the frame back in place with a couple of hits, pressed in the latches with all the strength my fingers could muster."


translate english day_2_f_7831b55b:


    "The cold left the room. But the fear was still present."


translate english day_2_f_b9adbede:


    "I placed my glasses on my nose and started studying my reflection in the window."


translate english day_2_f_c92c6322:


    "It didn't look like a face, more like a death mask."


translate english day_2_f_857ec97e:


    "Just like the one worn by the boy from the notice board."


translate english day_2_f_7eda86e8:


    "That night, I was on the edge of joining him there."


translate english day_2_f_cb3ba4fa:


